hadiths[251]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6640","ibne-Mus-hir aur Esa-bin-Yonus donon ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath khabar di, unhon-ne Esa ki riwayat mein : sachchey ka irada karta rehta hai aur jhoot ka irada karta rehta hai ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye aur ibne-Mus-hir ki riwayat main ( Allah ke nazdeek ke bajaey) yahan tak ke Allah usko likh leta hai ke alfaz hain."
"6641","Jarir ne hamein Aamash se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ibrahim Taimi se, unhon-ne Haris bin Suwed se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum log apne khayal mein raqoob kisey shumaar kartey ho? ham ne kaha : jis shakhs ke bachchey paida na hotey hun. aap ne farmaya : ye raqoob nahi hai, balke raqoob wo shakhs hai jisne ( aakhirat mein) kisi bachchey ko aagey na bheja ho. aap ne farmaya : tum apne khayal mein pahlwaan kisey samajhtey ho? ham ne kaha : jis ko log pachhaad na sakein . aap ne farmaya : pahlwaan wo nahi hai, balke pahlwaan to wo shakhs hai jo ghussey ke waqt khud par qaabu rakhta hai."
"6642","abu-Muawia aur Esa-bin-Yonus ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath usi ke ham mana riwayat ki."
"6643","Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (koi shakhs) pachhaad deney se taaqatwar nahi hota. taaqatwar ( mazbut ( wo hai jo ghussey ke waqt khud ko qaabu mein rakhta hai."
"6644","Zubaidi ne Zohri se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman ne bataya ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farmatey they : pachhaad deney se koi shakhs taaqatwar nahi hota. sahaba ne puchha : Allah ke rasool! phir taqatwar kon hai? aap ne farmaya : jo ghussey ke waqt khud ko qaabu mein rakhta hai."
"6645","Mamar aur Shuaib donon ne Zohri se khabar di, unhon-ne Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6646","Yahya-bin-Yahya aur Muhammad-bin Alaa ne kaha : hamein abu-Muawia ne Aamash se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Adi-bin-Sabit se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Sulaiman-bin Surad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : 2 aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aapas mein gaalam galoch kya, un 2 mein se aik ki aankhen surkh ho gain aur gardan ki ragein phool gaen to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey aik aisa kalima malum hai ke agar ye shakhs usey keh de to wo (ghussey ki) jis kaifiyat mein khud ko pa raha hai wo jati rahegi, (wo kalima hai) : ( اعوذبالله من الشيطان الرجيم (us aadmi ne kaha : kya aap mujh par junoon taari dekhtey hain? ibne- Alaa ki riwayat main ( sirf (aur kya aap dekhtey hain ke alfaz hain aur unhon-ne aadmi ka tazkira nahi kya."
"6647","abu-Usama ne kaha : maine Aamash se suna, wo keh rahe they : maine Adii-bin Sabit se suna, wo keh rahe they ke hamein Sulaiman-bin Surad (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney 2 aadmiyon ne aapas mein gaalam galoch kya. unmein se aik ko ghussa chadhna shuru ho gaya aur iska chehra surkh honey laga. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski taraf nazar ki aur farmaya : mujhey aik kalimey : ( اعوذبالله من الشيطان الرجيم (ka pata hai. agar ye shakhs wo ( kalima ( keh de to us se ye ( ghussa ( jata rahega. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (ye baat ( sunney walon mein se aik aadmi uth kar us shakhs ki taraf gaya aur kaha : tumhen pata hai ke abhi abhii Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya hai? aap ne farmaya hai : mujhey aik aisey kalimey : ( اعوذبالله من الشيطان الرجيم (ka pata hai. agar ye ( shakhs) wo ( kalima ( keh de to us se ye kaifiyat jati rahegi . us shakhs ne kaha : kya tum ye samajh rahe ho ke main junoon ka shikar ho gaya hun?"
"6648","Hafs bin Ghiyas ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"6649","Yunus bin-Muhammad ne Hammaad-bin-Salma se, unhon-ne Sabit se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab Allah Taala ne jannat mein Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) ki sura bana li to jab tak chaha un (ke jasad) ko wahan rakha. iblees iske ird-gird ghoom kar dekhney laga ke wo kaisa hai. jab usne dekha ke wo (jism) andar se khokhla hai to usne jaan liya ke usey is tarah paida kya gaya ke ye khud par qaabu nahi rakh sakta."
"6650","Behaz ne kaha : hamein Hammad ne isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6651","Mughira hazrami ne hamein abu-Zinaad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aaraj se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne ( musalman ( bhai se ladey to chehrey ( par maarney ( se ijtinab kare."
"6652","hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne abu-Zinad se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur kaha : jab tum mein se koi (doosrey ko) maarey."
"6653","Suhel ke walid ( Abu-Saleh ( ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai se ladey to chehrey ( par maarney ( se bachey."
"6654","Shoba ne hamein Qatada se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Ayub se suna, Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they. unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai se ladey to iske chehrey par tamaancha na maarey ."
"6655","Nasar bin Ali jahazmi ne kaha : hamein mere walid ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Musanna (bin Saeed) ne hadis bayan ki, neez mujhey Muhammad-bin-Hatim ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Musanna bin Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Abu-Ayub se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur ibne-abi Hatim ki hadis mein hai : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, aap ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se ladey to chehrey se ijtinab karey kyonke Allah ne Adam ko uski sura par banaya hai."
"6656","Hammam ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Abu-Ayub Yahya bin Malik muraaghi se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai se ladey to chehrey ( par maarney ( se bachey."
"6657","Hafs bin Ghiyas ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Hisham bin Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Sham (Syria) mein unka kuchh logon ke qareeb se guzra hua jinko dhoop mein khada kya gaya tha aur unke saron par Zaitoon ka tel daala gaya tha, unhon-ne puchha : ye kya ho raha hai? bataya gaya : unko khiraaj (na dene) ki wjah se saza di ja rahi hai to (Hazrat Hisham bin Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : Allah Taala un logon ko azab mein mubtala karega, jo duniya mein logon ko azab detey hain."
"6658","abu-Usama ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Hisham bin Hakeem-bin-Hizam (Raziallahu anhu) Sham (Syria) ke chand nabtiyon (Saami qaum / zameendaar logon (ke qareeb se guzrey , unhein dhoop mein khada kya gaya tha, unhon-ne puchha : unka mamla kya hai? logon ne bataya : unhein jiziye (ki adaaeygi ke mamley) mein mahboos kya gaya hai, to Hazrat Hisham (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : Allah Taala un logon ko azab dega jo duniya mein logon ko azab detey hain."
"6659","Wakee, abu-Muawia aur Jarir sab ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, aur Jarir ki hadis mein mazeed ye hai, kaha : aur Palestine par un dinon un logon ka ameer Umer bin Sad ( Ansari ( tha to wo ( Hisham (Raziallahu anhu)) unke paas gaey, unko hadis sunai to unhon-ne unke barey mein hukm diya, chunanche unko chhod diya gaya."
"6660","ibne-Shahab ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Hisham bin-Hakim (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik shakhs ko dekha, wo teiswin ka aamil tha. us ne nabtiyon mein se kuchh logon ko jiziye ki adaaeygi ke silsiley mein dhoop mein khada kya hua tha to unhon-ne puchha : ye kya hai? maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : bila shubah Allah Taala un logon ko mubtlaaey azab karega jo duniya mein logon ko azab mein mubtala kartey hain."
"6661","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Amr (bin Dinar ( se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : aik shakhs chand teer lekar masjid mein se guzra to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : un teeron ko unki nokon (ki taraf se) pakdo ."
"6662","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne Amr-bin-Dinar se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik shakhs chand teer lekar masjid mein se guzra , us ne unke paikaan khol rakhey they, aap ne hukm diya ke wo unhein paikaanon ( aagey waley lohey ke naukdaar hisson ( ki taraf se pakdey taake wo kisi musalman ko kharaash na laga dein."
"6663","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur Muhammad-bin Rumeh ne kaha : hamein Leis ne abu-Zubair se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne aik shakhs ko jo masjid mein kuchh teer bataur sadqa logon mein taqseem kar raha tha, hukm diya ke wo unko nokon se pakdey baghair unhein lekar ( logon ke darmyan mein se) na guzrey . ibne- Rumeh ne (apni riwayat mein) kaha : wo teeron ko bataur sadqa de raha tha."
"6664","Sabit ne abu-Barda se, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs majlis ya bazar mein se guzrey aur uske hath mein teer hon to wo unhein unke paikaanon (naukdaar hisson) se pakdey, phir (tanbeeh hai) unke nokeeley hissey ki taraf se pakdey, phir (takeed hai) unke nokeeley hisson ki taraf se pakdey. kaha : to Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qasam! (hamara ye haal hai ke) ham ne marney se pahley (apni usi zindagi mein) un teeron ko aik doosrey ke chehron ki taraf seedha kar liya hai."
"6665","Buraid ne abu-Barda se, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs hamari masjid ya hamarey bazar mein se guzrey aur uske paas teer hon to wo unhein apni hatheli se unke tez nokdaar hisson ki taraf se pakdey, kahin aisa na ho ke iska koi hissey musalmanon mein se kisi shakhs ko lag jaey. ya farmaya : wo unke paikaanon ko apni muththi mein pakdey ."
"6666","Ayub ne ( Muhammad ( Ibne-Sirin se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne apne bhai ki taraf lohey ke kisi hathiyar se ishara kya to is par Farishtey laanat kartey rahtey hain yahan tak ke wo us kaam ko tark kar de, chahey wo uska maan-jaya bhai hi kyon na ho."
"6667","Ibne-Aun ne Muhammad (bin Sirin ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6668","Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat hai, kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kin, phir unhon-ne kai hadison zikr kin, unmein se aik ye hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai ki taraf hathiyar se ishara na karey, kyonke tum mein se koi shakhs nahi janta ke shayad shaitan achcha iske hath mein usey harkat de (aur wo doosrey musalman ko lag jaey) aur wo ( jiske hath se hathiyar chaley ( jahannam ke garhey mein gir jaey."
"6669","Abu-Bakar ke aazad karda ghulam Sumai ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik shakhs rastey par chala ja raha tha, usne rastey par aik kaantey daar tehni dekhi to usey (eik taraf) hata diya. Allah Taala ne usey iska inaam diya to uski bakhshish farma di."
"6670","Suhel ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik shakhs rastey ke uper padi hui darakht ki aik shaakh ke paas se guzra to usne kaha : Allah ki qism ! main us shaakh ko musalmanon ke rastey se hata dunga taake ye unko eza na de to us shakhs ko jannat mein dakhil kar diya gaya."
"6671","Aamash ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, aap ne farmaya : maine aik shakhs ko dekha ke wo (is amal ke badley) jannat mein har taraf (nematon ke mazey) loot raha tha (kyonke) us ne rastey ke darmyan se aik aisey darakht ko kaat diya tha jo logon ko azeeyat deta tha."
"6672","abu-Raafe ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik darakht musalmanon ko azeeyat deta tha, chunanche aik shakhs aaya aur usey kaat diya to wo jannat mein dakhil ho gaya."
"6673","Aban bin Samaa ne kaha : mujhey abu-Waaze ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Hazrat abu-Barza (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke Nabi ! aap mujhey koi aisi baat sikha dein jisse main nafa hasil karun. aap ne farmaya : musalmanon ke rastey se takleef dene wali cheez ko hata diya karo."
"6674","Abu-Bakar bin Shuaib bin Habhaab ne abu-Waaze Raasbi se, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Barza (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : Allah ke rasool! mein nahi janta, ho sakta hai ke aap ( duniya se) tashrif ley jayen aur main aap ke baad zinda reh jaun , isliye aap mujhey ( aakhirat ke safar ke liye) koi zaade-raah ata kar dijiye jis se Allah Taala mujhey nafa ata farmaai , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : is tarah karo, is tarah karo. padhi. Abu-Bakar bin Shuaib un baton ko bhool gaey. padhi. aur (farmaya :) rastey se takleef deh chizon ko door kar diya karo."
"6675","Juweriya bin Asma ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aurat ko billi ki wjah se azab diya gaya, us ne billi ko baandhey rakha yahan tak ke wo mar gaee to wo usi wjah se jahannam mein dakhil ho gaee, kyonke jab us ne billi ko baandha to na usko khilaaya, na pilaya aur na usko chhoda ke wo (khud hi) zamin ke keedey makodey kha leti."
"6676","imam Malik-bin-Anas ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Juweriya ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki."
"6677","Ubaidullah-bin-Umar ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aurat ko billi ke sabab azab diya gaya jisey usne baandh rakha tha, us ne usey khaney ko diya na peeney ko diya, na usey chhoda ke wo zamin ke keedey makodey shikar se kha leti ."
"6678","Saeed Maqbari ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6679","Mamar ne hamein Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat ki, kaha : ye hadisein hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, unhon-ne kai hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik ye thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aurat apni billi ya billey ki wjah se dozakh mein chali gaee jis ko us ne baandh kar rakha tha, na khud usko khilaaya aur na usey chhoda ke zamin ke chhotey motey janwar chaba kha leti, yahan tak ke wo kamzor ho kar mar gaee."
"6680","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri aur Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, donon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : izzat jalaal waaley Allah ka tehband hai aur badai us (ke kandhon ( ki chadar hai. jo shakhs in ( sifaat (ke mamley mein mere madde-muqaabil mein aayega, main usey azab doonga."
"6681","abu-Imran jooni ne Hazrat Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aadmi ne kaha : Allah ki qasam! Allah Taala falan shakhs ko nahi bakhshnega, to Allah Taala ne farmaya : kon hai jo mujh par qism kha raha hai ke main falan ko nahi bakhshunga? maine (is ( falan ko to bakhsh diya aur (aisa kehney waley! ( terey sarey amal zaaye kar diye. ya jin alfaz mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya."
"6682","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bahut se ghubaar mein atey huey ( ghareebul-watan musaafir) bikhrey huey baalon waale, darwazon se dhutkaar diye janey waley log aisey hain ke agar unmein se koi Allah Taala par (aitimaad karke) qism kha ley to Allah Taala uski qism poori kar deta hai."
"6683","Hammad bin abi Salma aur Imam Malik ne Suhel bin abi Saleh se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab aik shakhs (ye) kehta hai : log halaak ho gaey to wo unhein halaak kar deta hai. (Imam Muslim ke aik shagird ( Abu-Ishaq ne kaha : mujhey (yaqeeni taur par) malum nahi ke (kaaf ke) zabar ke sath ( اهلكهم ( (is ne unhein halaak kar diya hai) ya pesh ke sath ( اهلكهم ( (un sabse badh kar halaak karne wala hai)."
"6684","Rooh bin-Qasim aur Sulaiman-bin Bilal ne Suhel se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6685","Malik-bin-Anas, Lais-bin-Sad aur Yazid-bin-Harun sab ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se riwayat ki, (usi tarah) Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz unhi ke hain. padhi. kaha : hamein abdul-wahaab Saqafi ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Yahya-bin-Saeed se suna, kaha : mujhey Abu-Bakar bin Muhammad-bin Amr bin Hazam ne khabar di ke Umra ne unko hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se suna, wo kehti thin : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : mujhey Jibreel musalsal hamsaaey ke sath husne-sulook ke liye kehtey rahe, yahan tak ke mujhey yaqin honey laga ke wo zaroor unhein wiraasat mein Sharik kar dengey."
"6686","Hisham-bin-Urwa ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6687","Umar-bin Muhammad ke walid ne kaha : maine Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Jibreel mujhey lagaataar hamsaaey ke sath husne-suluk ki talqeen kartey rahe yahan tak ke mujhey yaqin honey laga ke wo usey waaris ( bhi) bana dengey."
"6688","Abdul-Azeez bin Abdus-Samad Ami ne kaha : hamein abu-Imran Jawni ne Abdullah-bin Samit se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Abu-Zar! jab tum shorba pakaao to usmein pani zyada rakho aur apne padausiyon ko yad rakho."
"6689","Shoba ne abu-Imran Jawni se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Samit se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : mere khaleel (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey wasiiyat ki : jab tum shorbey wala saalan pakaao to usmein pani zyada rakho, phir apne hamsaayon mein se kisi (zarurat mand) gharaaney ko dekho aur is mein se kuchh achchhey tareeqey se unko bhijwa do."
"6690","Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : neki mein kisi cheez ko haqeer na samjho, chahey yahi ho ke tum apne (musalman) bhai ko khultey huey chehrey se milo."
"6691","Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jab koi zarurat mand aata to aap apne sath baithey huey logon ki taraf mutwajjeh hotey aur farmatey : tum (bhi uski) shafaat karo, tumhen bhi ajr diya jaeyga aur Allah Taala apne Nabi ki zaban se wahi faisla jari karaaega jo usko pasand hoga."
"6692","Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : nek padaus aur burey padaus ki misal mushk bechnewale aur bhattii dhonkney waley ki tarah hai, mushk bechnewale ya tum ko hadiye mein mushk de dega ya tum us se khareed logey, warna kam se kam tumhen us se achi khushbu aaeygi aur bhatti dhonkney wala ya to (chingaariyon se) tumharey kapdey jalaaeyga ya tumhen (is se) badboo aaeygi."
"6693","Mamar aur Shuaib ne ibne-Shahab Zohri se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Abdullah-bin abi-Bakr bin Hazam ne hadis bayan ki, unhein Urwa-bin-Zubair ne bataya ke Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : mere paas aik aurat aai, uske sath uski 2 betiyaan bhi thin, us ne mujh se (khana) maanga to usey mere paas aik khajoor ke siwa aur kuchh na mila. maine wahi usko de di, us ne wo khajoor lekar apni 2 betiyon mein taqseem kar di aur khud usmein se kuchh na khana, phir wo khadi hui, aur wo uski donon betiyaan chali gain, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas tashrif laey to maine aapko us aurat ki baat batai to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis kisi par betiyon ki parwarish ka baar pad jaey aur wo unke sath husne-sulook karey to wo uske liye jahannam se ( bachaney wala ( parda hongi ."
"6694","Irak bin Malik ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mere paas aik miskeen aurat aai jisne apni 2 betiyaan uthai hui thin, maine usko teen khajoorein din, usne unmein se har aik ko eik-eik khajoor di, (bachi hui) aik khajoor khaney ke liye apne munh ki taraf ley gaee, to wo bhi uski 2 betiyon ne khaney ke liye maang li, us ne wo khajoor bhi jo wo khana chahti thi, 2 hissey karke donon betiyon ko de di. mujhey iska ye kaam bahut achchha laga. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bataya to aap ne farmaya : Allah ne is (amal ( ki wjah se uske liye jannat pakki kar di hai ya ( farmaya : (us wjah se usey aag se aazad kar diya hai."
"6695","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne 2 ladkiyon ki unke baligh honey tak parwarish ki, qiyamat ke din wo aur main is tarah aaeingey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni ungliyon ko milaaya."
"6696","Imam Malik ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jis kisi musalman ke teen bachchey faut ho jayen to usey aag sirf qism pura karne ke liye chhueygi."
"6697","Sufiyan aur Mamar donon ne Zohri se Malik ki sanad ke sath unhi ke mafhoom mein hadis bayan ki, magar Sufiyan ki hadis mein hai : to wo sirf qism poori karne ke liye aag mein dakhil hoga."
"6698","Suhel ke walid ( Abu-Saleh ( ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ki aurton se farmaya : tum mein se jis aurat ke bhi teen bachchey faut ho jayen aur wo un ( par sabr kartey huey un (ka sawab Allah se talab karey to wo zaroor jannat mein dakhil hogi. unmein se aik aurat ne kaha : ya 2 ( bachchey faut ho jayen?) Allah ke rasool! to aap ne farmaya : ya 2 bachchey (faut ho jaaein.)"
"6699","abu-Awana ne Abdur-Rehman bin Asbahani se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh Zakwan se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik aurat aai aur kaha : aap ki guftgu (ka bada hissey ( mard le gaey, lihaza aap hamarey liye bhi apni taraf se aik din muqarrar farma dein ke ham aap ke paas aaya karein aur Allah ne aapko jo sikhaya hai is mein se aap hamein bhi sikhaa dein. aap ne farmaya : tum auratein falan-falan din ikatthi ho jaanaa. khawaateen ikatthi ho gain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas tashrif laey aur Allah ne jo ilm aapko ata farmaya tha usmein se unko bhi sikhaya, phir aap ne farmaya : tum mein se koi aurat nahi jo apne bachchon mein se teen bachchon ko apne aagey (Allah ke paas) rawaana kar de, magar wo uske liye aag se bachaney wala parda bin jaenge. aik aurat ne kaha : aur 2 bachchey bhi aur 2 bachchey bhi aur 2 bachchey bhi? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aur 2 bachchey bhi aur 2 bachchey bhi aur 2 bachchey bhii."
"6700","Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur Muaz ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abdur-Rehman bin Asbahani se isi sanad ke sath iske ham mana riwayat ki aur donon ne Shoba se (riwaayat kartey huey) mazeed ye kaha : Abdur-Rehman bin Asbahani se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : maine abu-Hazim se suna, wo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they, kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : teen bachchey jo bulooghat ki umr ko nahi pahunchey."
"6701","hamein Suwed-bin-Saeed aur Muhammad-bin Abdul-Aala ne hadis bayan ki. padhi. donon ke alfaz miltey-jultey hain. padhi. donon ne kaha : hamein Motamir (bin Sulaiman Taimi ( ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne abu-Saleel se aur unhon-ne abu-Hassaan se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : mere 2 bachchey faut ho gaey hain, aap hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kon si hadis suna saktey hain jis se aap hamein hamarey faut honey walon ke mutaalliq hamarey dilon ki tasalli dila sakein? ( abu-Hassaan ne) kaha : (hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : haan. (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( chhotey bachchey jannat ke pani ke keedey hain (wo jannat ke andar hi rahtey hain) unmein se koi apne bap . padhi. ya farmaya : apne maan-baap ko milega to wo usey uske kapdey se pakad lega. padhi. ya kaha : uske hath se, jis tarah maine tumharey us kapdey ke kinarey se pakda hua hai, phir us waqt tak nahi hatega . padhi. ya kaha : nahi rukega, yahan tak ke Allah usey aur uske walid ko jannat mein dakhil kar dega aur Suwed ki riwayat main (abu-Saleel se riwayat hai ke bajaey yun) hai : hamein abu-Saleel ne hadis sunai."
"6702","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Taimi se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur kaha : aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se koi aisi baat suni hai jis se aap hamarey faut ho janey walon ke hawale se hamarey dilon ko tasalli dila sakein? (hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : haan."
"6703","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Numer aur abu-Saeed ashajj ne hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz Abu-Bakar ke hain. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : hamein Hafs bin Ghiyas ne hadis bayan ki, neez hamein Umar-bin Hafs bin Ghiyas ne hadis bayan ki. unhon-ne kaha : hamein mere walid ne apne dada Talaq bin Muawiya se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa bin-Amr bin Jarir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas apne bachchey ko lekar aai aur kaha : Allah ke Nabi ! Allah Taala se uske haq mein dua farmaiye, main teen bachchey dafn kar chuki hun. aap ne farmaya : tum ne teen ( bachchon ( ko dafn kya hai? usne kaha : ji haan , aap ne farmaya : tum ne dozakh se bchney ke liye aik mazbut baad laga di hai. umr (bin Hafs ( ne kaha : unhon-ne apne dada ( Talaq ( se riwayat ki aur baaqiyon ne kaha : Talaq se riwayat hai aur dada ka zikr nahi kya."
"6704","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein Jarir ne Talaq bin Muawiya Nakhai abu-Ghayaas se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa bin-Amr bin Jarir se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik aurat apne betey ko lekar aai to usne kaha : Allah ke rasool! ye bimar hai aur main iske barey mein) sakht ( khof ka shikar hun, main (apne) teen bachchey dafn kar chuki hun, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne dozakh se bchney ke liye mazbut baad bana li hai. Zuhair ne kaha : Talaq se riwayat hai aur kunniyat ( abu-Ghayaas (ka zikr nahi kya."
"6705","Jarir ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid (Abu-Saleh) se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab Allah Taala kisi bandey se mohabbat karta hai to Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ko bulata hai aur farmata hai : main falan se mohabbat karta hun tum bhi us se mohabbat karo, kaha : to Jibreel (Alaihissalam) us se mohabbat kartey hain, phir wo aasman mein awaz detey hain, kehtey hain : Allah Taala falan shakhs se mohabbat karta hai, tum bhi us se mohabbat karo, chunanche aasman waley us se mohabbat kartey hain, kaha : phir uske liye zamin mein maqbooliyat rakh di jati hai, aur jab Allah Taala kisi bandey se bughz rakhta hai to Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ko bula kar farmata hai : main falan shakhs se bughz rakhta hun, tum bhi us se bughz rakho, to Jibreel (Alaihissalam) us se bughz rakhtey hain, phir wo aasman walon mein elaan kartey hain ke Allah Taala falan se bughz rakhta hai, tum bhi us se bughz rakho, kaha : to wo (sab) us se bughz rakhtey hain, phir uske liye zamin mein bhi bughz rakh diya jata hai."
"6706","Abdul-Azeez darawardi, Alaa bin Musaiyab aur imam Malik-bin-Anas sab ne Suhel se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, albatta Alaa bin Musaiyab ki hadis mein bughz ka zikr nahi hai) sirf mohabbat karne ki baat hai.)"
"6707","Abdul-Azeez bin-Abdullah-bin abi Salma maajishoon ne Suhel se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Arfa mein they ke Hazrat Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez ka wahan se guzar hua aur wo Haj ke ameer they, log khadey ho kar unhein dekhney lagey, maine apne walid se kaha : abba jaan! main ye dekh raha hun ke Allah Taala Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez se mohabbat karta hai, unhon-ne puchha : iska kya sabab hai? maine kaha : isliye ke logon ke dilon mein unki mohabbat paai jati hai, unhon (Abu-Saleh ( ne kaha : tera bap qurbaan ho ! tum ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadis suni hai. iske baad unhon-ne Suhel se Jarir ki riwayat ki hui hadis bayan ki."
"6708","Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : roohein aik doosrey ke sath rehney wali jamatein hain. unmein se jo aik doosrey (ki aik jaisi sifaat ( se aagah ho gain unmein yakjaai ( الفت (ho gaee aur) sifaat ke ikhtilaf ki bina par) jo aik doosrey se gurezaan rahen wo aapasi mukhtalif ho gain."
"6709","Yazeed bin Asamm ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se marfooan aik hadis bayan ki, kaha : log soney chandi ki kanon ki tarah madaniyaat ki kaanein hain, jo zamana jahiliyat mein achchhey they wo agar Deen ko samajh lein to zamana Islam mein bhi achchhey hain. aur roohein aik sath rehney wali jamatein hain jo aapas mein (eik jaisi sifaat ki bina par) aik doosrey ko pahchaanney lagein unmein yakjaai paida ho gaee aur jo (sifaat ke ikhtilaf ki bina par) aik doosrey se gurezaan rahen, wo aapas mein mukhtalif ho gain."
"6710","Ishaq bin-Abdullah-bin abi Talha ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik dehati ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha : qiyamat Kab aaeygi? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : tum ne uske liye kya taiyaar kar rakha hai? usne kaha : Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki mohabbat. aap ne farmaya : tum usi ke sath hogey jis se tum ko mohabbat hai."
"6711","Sufiyan ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik shakhs ne puchha : Allah ke rasool! qiyamat Kab hogi ? aap ne farmaya : tum ne uske liye kya taiyaar ki hai? us ne zyada chizon ka zikr nahi kya, (chand aik kaamon ka zikr kar saka) usne kaha : aur lekin main Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mohabbat karta hun, aap ne farmaya : tum iske sath hogey jis se tumhen mohabbat hai."
"6712","Mamar ne Zohri se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik dehati aaya, usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah magar (is mein hai ke) usne kaha : maine uske liye kuchh zyada taiyaari nahi ki jis par main apni tareef kar sakun (lekin main Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mohabbat karta hun.)"
"6713","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne kaha : hamein Sabit Bunani ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! qiyamat Kab hogi? aap ne farmaya : tum ne uske liye kya taiyaar kya hai? usne kaha : Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki mohabbat . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum usi ke sath hogey jis se tum ko mohabbat hogi. Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Islam qabool karne ke baad hamein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad se badh kar aur kisi baat se itni khushi nahi hui : tum iske sath hogey jis se tum ko mohabbat hogi. Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) se mohabbat karta hun aur mujhey ummeed hai ke main unke sath hunga, har chand ke maine unki tarah amal nahi kiye."
"6714","Jafar bin Sulaiman ne hamein hadis sunai, kaha : hamein Sabit Bunani ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis sunai, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki aur unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ka ye qaul ke main ( Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) se mohabbat karta hun, aur uske baad wali baat bayan nahi ki."
"6715","Mansoor ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : aik baar jab main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid se nikal rahe they, to masjid ki chaukhat ke paas hamari aik shakhs se mulaqat hui, usne kaha : Allah ke rasool! qiyamat Kab hai? aap ne farmaya : tum ne uske liye kya taiyaar kya hai? to jaisey wo thithak gaya, phir usne kaha : Allah ke rasool! maine uske liye bahut zyada namazein, bahut zyada rozey aur bahut zyada sadqaat to taiyaar nahi kiye, lekin main Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mohabbat rakhta hun, aap ne farmaya : tum usi ke sath hogey jis se tumhen mohabbat hogi."
"6716","Amr-bin-Murra ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6717","abu-Awana , Shoba aur Hisham ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis riwayat ki."
"6718","Jarir ne ( Sulaiman ( Aamash se, unhon-ne abu-Waeil se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya, usne kaha : Allah ke rasool! aap us shakhs ko kaisey dekhtey hain jo kisi qaum se mohabbat karta hai magar abhi tak iske sath nahi mila? (aemal mein unse bahut peechhey hai) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aadmi usi ke sath hoga jis se wo mohabbat karta hai."
"6719","Shoba aur Sulaiman-bin-Qarm ne Sulaiman (Aamash) se, unhon-ne abu-Waeil se, unhon-ne Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6720","abu-Muawia aur Muhammad-bin Ubaid ne Aamash se, unhon-ne ( abu-Waeil ( Shaqiq se aur unhon-ne abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik shakhs aaya, phir Aamash se Jarir ki riwayat ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6721","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne abu-Imran Joni se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Samit se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya : aap ka kya khayal hai ke aik shakhs achchhey kaam karta hai aur log uski tareef kartey hain? aap ne farmaya : ye momin ke liye fauri basharat hai."
"6722","Wakee, Muhammad-bin-Jafar , Abdus-Samad aur Nazar sab ne Shoba se, unhon-ne abu-Imran Joni se Hammad-bin-Zaid ki sanad ke sath , usi ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki, magar Shoba se Abdus-Samad ke siwa (baqi) sab ki hadis mein hai : aur log uski wjah se uske sath mohabbat kartey hain. aur Abdus-Samad ki hadis mein hai : aur log uski tareef kartey hain jis tarah Hammad ne kaha hai."
"6723","Abdullah-bin-Numair Hamdani, abu-Muawia aur Wakee ne hamein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne Zaid-bin Wahab se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood) (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam), aur wo sach bataatey hain aur unhein (wahi ke zariey se) sach bataya jata hai, ne farmaya : tum mein se har aik shakhs ka maadda takhleeq chalis (40) din tak uski maa ke pet mein ikattha kya jata hai, phir wo itni muddat (chalis (40) din) ke liye alaqa (jonk ki tarah rehem ki diwar ke sath chipka hua) rehta hai, phir itni hi muddat ke liye muzgha ki shakl mein rehta hai (jis mein reedh ki haddi ke nishanat daant se chabai janey ke nishanat se mushabeh (similar) hotey hain.) phir Allah Taala Farishtey ko bhejta hai jo (paanchwein mahiney neuro-cell, yani dimagh ki takhleeq ho janey ke baad) usmein Rooh phoonkta hai. aur usey char baton ka hukm diya jata hai ke iska rizq, uski Umar, iska amal aur ye ke wo khush naseeb hoga ya bad-nasib, likh liya jaey. mujhey us zaat ki qism jiske siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi! tum mein se koi aik shakhs ahle-jannat ke se amal karta rehta hai, yahan tak ke jab iske aur jannat ke darmyan aik baalisht ka fasla reh jata hai to (Allah ke ilm ke mutabiq ( likha hua is par ghalib aa jata hai to wo ahale-jahannam ka amal kar leta hai aur us (jahannam) mein dakhil ho jata hai. aur tum mein se aik shakhs ahale-jahannam ke se amal karta rehta hai yahan tak ke iske aur jahannam ke darmyan aik baalisht ka fasla reh jata hai to (Allah ke ilm ke mutabiq) likha hua is par ghalib aa jata hai aur wo ahle-jannat ka amal kar leta hai aur us (jannat) mein dakhil ho jata hai."
"6724","Usman bin abi Sheba aur Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne hamein hadis bayan ki, donon ne Jarir bin abdul-hameed se riwayat ki, neez hamein Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne Esa-bin-Yonus se khabar di aur abu-Saeed ashajj ne mujhey bayan kya, kaha : hamein Wakee ne hadis bayan ki ke Ubaidullah-bin-Muaz ne kaha : hamein mere walid ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Shoba bin Hajjaj ne hadis bayan ki, un sab ( Jareer, Esa , Wakee aur Shoba ( ne Aamash se, isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki. Wakee ki hadis mein kaha : tum mein se aik insan ka maadda takhleeq chalis (40) raaton tak apni maa ke pet mein ikattha (honey ke marhaley mein) hota hai. aur Shoba se Muaz ki hadis mein chalis (40) raatein ya chalis (40) din aur Jarir aur Esa ki hadis mein chalis (40) din hai."
"6725","Amr-bin-Dinar ne abu-Tufail (Aamir bin Wasila (Raziallahu anhu)) se, unhon-ne Huzefa bin Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki jo unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchai (marfooa bayan ki), Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab nutfa (chalis (40) chaalees dinon ke 2 marhalon ke baad teesrey marhaley mein) chalis (40) ya paintaalees raatein rehem mein thehra rehta hai to ( Allah ka muqarrar kya hua) farishta uske paas jata hai aur kehta hai : aey rab! ye khush naseeb hoga ya bad-naseeb hoga? to donon (baton mein se Allah jo bataaey us) ko likh liya jata hai, phir kehta hai : aey rab! ye mard hai ya aurat? phir donon (main se jo Allah bataaey us) ko likh liya jata hai, phir iska amal, iske qadmon ke nishanat, uski muddat umr aur iska rizq likh liya jata hai, phir (indraaj ke) saheefey lapet diye jatey hain, phir unmein koi cheez badhaai jati hai, na kam ki jati hai."
"6726","Amr-bin-Haris ne abu-Zubair Makki se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Aamir bin Wasila (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : bad-bakht wo hai jo apni maa ke pet main (tha to Allah ke ilm ke mutabiq ( bad-bakht tha aur khush-naseebi mand wo hai jo apne ilawa doosrey se nasihat hasil karey, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se aik shakhs aaey jinhein Hazrat Huzefa bin Usaid Ghifari (Raziallahu anhu) kaha jata tha, unhon (Aamir bin Wasila (Raziallahu anhu)) ne unko Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ke alfaz mein ye hadis sunai aur (unse poochhney ke liye) kaha : wo shakhs koi amal kiye baghair bad-bakht kaisey ho jata hai? to us ( Aamir (Raziallahu anhu)) ko aadmi ( Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : kya aap is par tajjub kartey hain? maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai : jab nutfey par (teesrey marhaley ki) bayaalees raatein guzar jati hain to Allah Taala uske paas aik farishta bhejta hai, wo uski sura banata hai, iske kaan , aankhen , khaal , gosht aur uski haddiyaan banata hai, phir kehta hai : aey mere rab! ye mard hoga ke aurat? phir tumhara rab jo chahta hota hai wo faisla bataata hai aur farishta likh leta hai, phir wo kehta hai : aey mere rab! uski muddat hayaat (kitni hogi?) phir tumhara rab jo uski marzi hoti hai, bataata hai aur farishta likh leta hai, phir wo (farishta) kehta hai : aey mere rab! uska rizq (kitna hoga? ( to tumhara rab jo chahta hota hai wo faisla bataata hai aur farishta likh leta hai, phir farishta apne hath mein saheefa lekar nikal jata hai, chunanche wo shakhs kisi mamley mein na us se badhta hai, na kam hota hai."
"6727","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne khabar di ke abu-Tufail (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they aur Amr-bin-Haris ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6728","Yahya bin abu-Bukair ne kaha : hamein abu-Khaisma Zuhair ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Abdullah-bin Ata ne hadis bayan ki, unhein Ikrima bin Khalid ne hadis bayan ki, unhein abu-Tufail (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : main abu Sareeha Huzefa bin Usaid Ghifari (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas hazir hua to unhon-ne kaha : maine apne un donon kanon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai : nutfa (asl mein teen marhalon mein chalis (40) ( chalis (40) raatein maa k pet mein rehta hai, phir farishta uski sura banata hai. Zuhair ne kaha : mera guman hai ke unhon-ne kaha : ( farishta ( usey banata hai : to wo kehta hai : aey mere rab! aurat hogi ya mard hoga? phir Allah Taala uske muzakkar ya muannas honey ka faisla bata deta hai, wo (farishta) phir kehta hai : aey mere rab! mukammal (poorey aaza wala hai) ya ghair mukammal? phir Allah Taala mukammal ya ghair mukammal honey ke barey mein apna faisla bata deta hai, phir wo kehta hai : aey mere parwardigar ! uska rizq kitna hoga? uski muddate-hayaat kitni hogi ? uska akhlaq kaisa hoga? phir Allah Taala uske bad-bakht ya khush-bakht honey ke barey mein bhi (jo tay ho chuka) bata deta hai."
"6729","kulsoom ne abu-Tufail (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi Hazrat Huzefa bin Usaid Ghifari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne ye hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se marfuan riwayat ki : takhleeq ke doran mein raham par aik farishta muqarrar hota hai, jab Allah Taala apne izn se koi cheez paida karna chahta hai to chalis (40) aur kuchh uper raatein guzarney ke baad phir un sab ki riwayat ki hui hadis ke mutabiq bayan kya."
"6730","Ubaidullah-bin-abi-Bakr ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne ye hadis marfooan bayan ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waala Allah raham par aik farishta muqarrar kar deta hai, wo kehta hai : aey mere rab! ( ab) ye nutfa hai, aey mere rab! ( ab ( ye alaqa hai, aey mere rab! ( ab ye muzgha hai, phir jab Allah Taala uski (insan ki sura mein) takhleeq ka faisla karta hai to unhon-ne kaha : farishta kehta hai : aey mere rab! mard ho ya aurat? bad-bakht ho ya khush naseeb? rizq kitna hoga? muddate-Umar kitni hogi? wo maan ke pet mein hota hai aur isi tarah (sab kuchh) likh liya jata hai."
"6731","Jarir ne hamein Mansoor se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Sad bin Ubeda se, unhon-ne abu-Abdur-Rehman se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham aik janazey ke sath Baqee gharqad mein they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur baith gaey, ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ird-gird baith gaey. aap ne apna sar Mubarak jhuka liya aur apni chhadi se zamin kuredney lagey (jis tarah ke fikr mandi ke aalim mein hon.) phir farmaya : tum mein se koi aik bhi nahi, koi saans leney wala jaandaar shakhs nahi, magar Allah Taala ne (apne asli hamesha ke aur kabhi na khatm honewale ilm ke mutabiq) jannat ya jahannam mein uska thikana likh diya hai aur (koi nahi) magar (ye bhi) likh diya gaya hai ke wo bad-bakht hai ya khush bakht. kaha : to kisi aadmi ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! kya ham apne likhe par hi na reh jayen aur amal chhod dein? to aap ne farmaya : jo khush bakhton mein se hoga to wo khush bakhton ke amal ki taraf chal padega. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya : amal karo, har aik ka rasta aasan kar diya gaya hai. jo khush-bakht hain unke liye khush bakhton ke aamaal ka rasta aasan kar diya jata hai aur jo bad-bakht hain unke liye bad-bakhton ke amalon ka rasta aasan kar diya jata hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tilawat kya : to wo shakhs jisne ( Allah ki raah mein) diya aur taqwa ikhtiyar kya aur achi baat ki tasdeeq kar di to ham usey aasani ki zindagi (tak pahunchne) ke liye sahoolat ata karengey aur wo jisne kanjoosi ki aur be parwaai ikhtiyar ki aur achi baat ko jhutlaya to ham usey mushkil zindagi (tak janey) ke liye sahoolat dengey."
"6732","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Hannaad bin Sari ne hamein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein abu-Ahwas ne Mansoor se isi sanad ke sath usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki aur kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik lakdi pakdi aur chhadi nahi kaha, aur ibne-Abi-Sheba ne abu-Ahwas se bayan ki hui apni hadis mein (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kai jagah) kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tilawat ki."
"6733","Wakee, Abdullah-bin-Numair aur abu-Muawia ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne Sad-bin-Ubaida se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Abdur-Rehman Salma se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din baithey huey they, aur aap ke hath mein aik chhadi thi jis se aap zamin kured rahe they, phir aap ne apna sare-aqdas utha kar farmaya : tum mein se koi zi-Rooh nahi magar jannat aur dozakh mein iska maqam (pahley se) malum hai. unhon (sahaba) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! phir ham kis liye amal karein? ham usi (likhe huey) par takiya na karein? aap ne farmaya : nahi, tum amal karo, har shakhs ke liye usi ki sahoolat muyassar hai jis (ko khud apne amal ke zariey hasil karne) ke liye usko paida kya gaya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne : to wo shakhs jisne (Allah ki raah mein) diya aur achi baat ki tasdeeq ki, se lekar to ham usey mushkil zindagi (tak janey) ke liye sahoolat dengey tak padha ."
"6734","hamein Shoba ne Mansoor aur Aamash se hadis bayan ki, un donon ne Sad bin Ubeda se suna, wo abu-Abdur-Rehman Salma se, wo Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se aur wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat kar rahe they."
"6735","abu-Khaisma Zuhair (bin Harab ( ne abu-Zubair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Suraqa bin Malik bin Jasham (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! aap hamarey liye Deen ko is tarah bayan kijiye, maano ham abhi paida kiye gaey hain, aaj ka amal (jo ham kar rahe hain) kis naua mein aata hai? kya usmein jisey (likhney wali) qalmein (likh kar) khushk ho chukin aur jo paimaney muqarrar kiye gaey hain unka silsila jari ho chuka hai (ham bas unhi ke mutabiq amal kiye ja rahe hain?) ya usmein jo ham naey sirey se kar rahe hain (pahley se unke barey mein kuchh tay nahi?) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi, balke jisey likhney wali qalmein (likh kar) khushk ho chukin aur jinke muqarrar shuda paimaanon ke mutabiq amal shuru ho chuka. unhon-ne kaha : to phir amal kis liye (kya jaaey?) Zuhair ne kaha : phir iske baad abu-Zubair ne koi baat ki jo main nahi samajh saka, to maine puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaaya? unhon-ne kaha : (aap ne farmaya :) tum amal karo, har aik ko sahoolat muyassar ki gaee hai."
"6736","Amr-bin-Haris ne abu-Zubair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi maana mein riwayat ki aur is mein ye alfaz hain : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : har amal karne wala apne amal ke liye aasani paata hai."
"6737","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne Yazeed Zubai se riwayat ki, kaha : hamein Mutarrif ne Hazrat Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya : Allah ke rasool! kya ye malum hai ke jahannam walon se ( alag ( jannat waley kon hain? kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : haan. kaha gaya : to phir amal karne waley kis liye amal karein? aap ne farmaya : har aik ko usi (manzil ki taraf janey) ki suhoolat muyassar kar di jati hai jis (tak apne aamaal ke zariey pahunchne) ke liye usey paida kya gaya tha."
"6738","Abdul-Waris, ibne-Ulaih, Jafar bin Sulaiman aur Shoba sab ne Yazeed rashk se isi sanad ke sath Hammad ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki aur Abdul-Waris ki hadis mein (kaha gaya ke bajaey) is tarah hai : ( Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool!"
"6739","Yahya-bin-Yamar ne abu Aswad daili se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha : tumhara kya khayal hai ke jo amal log aaj kar rahe hain aur is mein mashaqqat utha rahe hain, kya ye aisi cheez hai jiska unke barey mein faisla ho chuka aur pahley hi se muqaddar hai jo unmein jari ho chuka hai ya wo naey sirey se unke samney pesh ki ja rahi hai, jis tarah usey unke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas laey hain aur un par hujjat qaaim hui hai? maine jawab diya : balke jis tarah unke barey mein faisla ho chuka hai aur uska silsila unmein jari hai. (daili ne) kaha : to (Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : to kya ye zulm nahi? (daili ne) kaha : to is baat par main sakht khaufzada aur pareshan ho gaya aur maine kaha : har cheez Allah ki paida ki hui hai aur uski milkiyat hai. jo bhi wo karey us se puchha nahi ja sakta aur wo (uske mamlook bandey) jo karein unse puchha ja sakta hai. to unhon-ne mujh se kaha : Allah tum par raham karey ! maine jo tum se puchha sirf isi liye puchha tha taake tumhari aql ka imtihaan lun. muzena ke 2 aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! aap kis tarah dekhtey hain, log jo amal aaj kar rahe aur is mein mashaqqat utha rahe hain koi aisi cheez hai jiska unke barey mein faisla ho chuka aur pahley se muqaddar hai jo unmein jari ho chuki hai ya wo ab unke samney pesh ki ja rahi hai, jis tarah usey unke rasool unke paas laey hain aur un par hujjat tamam hui hai? to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi, balke aisi cheez hai jo unke barey mein tay ho gaee hai aur unmein jari ho chuki, aur uski tasdeeq izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ki kitab mein hai : aur nafse-insani aur us zaat ki qism jisne usko theek banaya ! phir usko uski badi bhi ilhaam kar di aur neki bhi."
"6740","Alaa ke walid (Abdur-Rehman) ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bila shubah insan aik lambi muddat tak ahle-jannat ke se amal karta rehta hai, phir uske liye uske amal ka khaatma ahale-jahannam ke se amal par hota hai aur bila shubah aik aadmi lamba zamana ahale-jahannam ke se amal karta rehta hai, phir uske liye uske amal ka khaatma ahle-jannat ke se amal par hota hai."
"6741","Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik shakhs, jis tarah wo logon ko nazar aa raha hota hai, ahle-jannat ke se amal kar raha hota hai, lekin (aakhir kaar) wo ahale-jahannam mein se hota hai aur aik aadmi, jis tarah se wo logon ko nazar aa raha hota hai ahale-jahannam ke se amal kar raha hota hai lekin (anjame-kaar) wo ahle-jannat mein se hota hai."
"6742","Muhammad-bin-Hatim, Ibrahim bin-Dinar, ibne-abi-Umar Makki aur Ahmad-bin-Abda Zabi ne hamein ibne-Uena se hadis bayan ki, alfaz ibne- Hatim aur ibne-Dinar ke hain. padhi. un donon ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan bin-Amr (bin Dinar) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Taaus se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Hazrat Adam aur Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) ne (eik doosrey ko) apni apni daleelein din. Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha : Adam! aap hamarey walid hain, aap ne hamein naakam kar diya aur hamein jannat se bahar nikal laey. Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) ne farmaya : tum Musa ho, tumhen Allah Taala ne apni ham kalaami ke liye muntakhab farmaya aur apne hath se tumharey liye (apne ehkaam ko) likha, kya tum mujhey is baat par malaamat kar rahe ho jisey Allah Taala ne mere barey mein mujhey paida karne se bhi chalis (40) saal pahley muqaddar kar diya tha? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : to Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) (daleel mein) Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) par ghalib aa gaey, Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) par ghalib aa gaey. ibne-abi-Umar aur ibne- Abda ki hadis mein hai ke aik ne kaha : likha aur doosrey ne kaha : tumharey liye apne hath se Taurait likhi."
"6743","abu-Zinad ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Hazrat Adam aur Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) ne aik doosrey ko dalaayel diye aur Adam (Alaihissalam) ne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko daleel se haraa diya. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne unse kaha : aap wahi Adam hain jinhoney ( khud ghalati karke apni aulad ke) logon ko ghaltiyaan karne ka rasta dikhaya aur unhein jannat se nikalwaa diya ? to Adam (Alaihissalam) ne farmaya : tumhi ho jisey Allah ne har cheez ka ilm diya aur jisey logon mein se apni risalat ke liye muntakhab farmaaya? unhon-ne kaha : haan, (to Adam (Alaihissalam) ne) farmaya : tum mujhey is baat par malaamat kar rahe ho jo mujhey paida kiye janey se bhi pahley mere muqaddar kar di gaee thi?"
"6744","Haris bin abi Zubab ne Yazeed bin Hurmuz aur Abdur-Rehman Aaraj se riwayat ki, un donon ne kaha : ham ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Hazrat Adam aur Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) ne apne rab ke samney aik doosrey ko daleelein din aur Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) daleel mein Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) par ghalib aa gaey, Hazrat Musa ne kaha : aap wo Adam hain jinko Allah Taala ne apne hath se paida kya, aur aap main apni Rooh ko phoonka aur aapko farishton se sajda karaya aur aapko apni jannat mein rakha, phir aap ne apni ghalati se logon ko jannat se nikalwa kar zamin mein utarwa diya? Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) ne farmaya : tum wo Musa ho jisey Allah Taala ne apni risalat aur apni ham kalaami ke zariey se fazeelat bakhshi aur tumhen (Taurait ki) wo takhtey ata kin jin mein har cheez ki wazaahat hai aur tumhen sargoshi kiye janey wala bana kar apna qurb ata farmaya, (tum ye bataao) tumharey ilm ke mutabiq Allah ne meri paidaaish se kitni muddat pahley Taurait ko (is sura mein) likha (jis tarah wo tum par nazil huii?) Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha : chalis (40) saal se (qabl.) Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) ne kaha : kya tum ne usmein ye ( likha hua) paya : Adam ne apne parwardigar (ke hukm ( se sartaabi ki aur raah se hat gaya? (hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) ne) kaha : haan, to unhon-ne kaha : kya tum mujhey is baat par malaamat kar rahe ho ke maine wo kaam kya jo Allah ne meri paidaaish se chalis (40) saal pahley mujh par likh diya tha ke main wo kaam karunga? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : is tarah Adam (Alaihissalam) ne daleel se Musa (Alaihissalam) ko laa-jawaab kar diya."
"6745","Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Hazrat Adam aur Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) ne dalaayel ka tabadla kya. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha : aap Adam hain jinki khata ne unhein jannat se bahar nikala? to Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) ne unse kaha : kya tum Musa ho jisey Allah ne apni risalat aur ham kalaami se dusron par fazeelat di, phir tum mujhey us mamley mein malamat kar rahe ho jo meri paidaaish se pahley mere liye muqaddar kar diya gaya tha? is tarah Adam (Alaihissalam) ne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko daleel se khamosh kar diya."
"6746","abu-Salma aur Hammam-bin-Munabba ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un (guzishta rawiyon) ki hadis ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"6747","Muhammad-bin-Sirin ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un sab ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6748","ibne-Wahab ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey abu-Haani Kholani ne abu Abdur-Rehman habli se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : Allah Taala ne aasmanon aur zamin ko paida karne se pachaas hazaar saal pahley makhlooqat ki taqdeerein tehreer farma dein thi. farmaya : aur iska arsh pani par tha."
"6749","Hewa aur Naafe bin Yazeed ne abu-Haani se isi sanad ke sath usi hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki magar un donon ne ye nahi kaha : aur uska arsh pani par tha."
"6750","Hewa ne hamein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey abu-Haani ne bataya, unhon-ne abu-Abdur-Rehman habli se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) ko bayan kartey huey suna, kaha : unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : bani-Adam ke sarey dil aik dil ki sura mein Allah Taala ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmyan hain, wo jis tarah chahta hai usey (un sab ko) ghumaata hai. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( dua kartey huey) farmaya : aey Allah ! aey dilon ko pherney waley! hamarey dilon ko apni itaat par pher de."
"6751","Amr bin Muslim ne Taaus se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke bahut si sahaba ko paya wo sab ke sab ye kehtey they ke har cheez (Allah ki muqarrar karda) miqdar se hai aur maine Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : har cheez ( Allah ki muqarrar karda ( miqdar se hai yahan tak ke (kisi kaam ko) na kar sakna aur kar sakna bhi, ya kaha : ( kisi kaam ko) kar sakna aur na kar sakna ( bhi usi miqdar se hai.)"
"6752","Muhammad-bin Ibad bin Jafar makhzumi ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : mushrekeen Quraish taqdeer ke barey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bahas karne ke liye aaey, us waqt (ye aayat ( nazil hui : jis din wo jahannam mein aundhey munh ghaseetey jaeinge , (kaha jaeyga : ( dozakh ka azab chakho , be-shak ham ne har cheez ko) tay shuda ( miqdar ke mutabiq banaya hai."
"6753","Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim aur abd bin Humaid ne hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz Ishaq ke hain. padhi. donon ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Razzaq ne khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Mamar ne ibne-Taaus se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : jo Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, maine us se badh kar (Quran ke lafz ( alif-lam-mim se mushabeh (similar) koi aur cheez nahi dekhi, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne ibne-Aadam par iske hissey ka zina likh diya hai, wo laa-muhaala apna hissey lega. aankh ka zina (jiska dekhna haram hai usko) dekhna hai. zaban ka zina (haram baat) kehna hai, dil tamanna rakhta hai, khahish karta hai, phir sharmgaah uski tasdeeq karti hai (aur wo zina ka irtikaab kar leta hai) ya takzeeb karti hai (aur wo iska irtikaab nahi karta.) abd ne apni riwayat mein kaha : ibne-Taaus ne apne walid se riwayat ki (kaha :) maine Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, (is sanad mein samaa ki sarahat hai.)"
"6754","Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : ibne-Aadam ke mutaalliq zina mein se iska hissey likh diya gaya hai. wo la muhaala usko hasil karne wala hai, to donon aankhen, unka zina dekhna hai aur donon kaan, unka zina sunnaa hai aur zaban, iska zina baat karna hai aur hath, iska zina pakadna hai aur paon, iska zina chal kar jana hai aur dil tamanna rakhta hai aur khahish karta hai aur sharmgaah un tamam baton ki tasdeeq karti hai (usey amalan sach kar dikhaati hai aur haram ka irtikaab ho jata hai) ya usko jhutla deti hai (haqiqi zina se bachao ho jata hai.)"
"6755","Zubaidi ne Zohri se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke wo kaha kartey they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : har paida honey wala bachcha fitrat (Allah par eman aur achai ki mohabbat) par paida hota hai, phir iske maan-baap usko yahudi, nasrani aur majusi bana detey hain, jaisey aik janwar (maan) aaza mein kaamil janwar (bachchey) ko janm deti hai, kya tumhen unmein koi uzu (khaas ang) kata hua janwar nazar aata hai? phir Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey they : tum chaho to ye aayat padh lo : yahi Allah ki) ata karda ( fitrat hai jis par us ne logon ki takhleeq farmai, Allah ki takhleeq mein raddo-badal nahi hota."
"6756","Mamar ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur kaha : jis tarah aik (maadda) janwar bachchey ko janm deti hai. unhon-ne aaza mein kaamil zikr nahi kya."
"6757","Yunus bin Yazeed ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki, unhein abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne bataya ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi paida honey wala bachcha nahi magar uski wilaadat fitrat par hoti hai. phir ( Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu)) kehtey : ye aayat padh lo : yahi Allah ki) ata karda ( fitrat hai jis par us ne logon ki takhleeq ki, Allah ki takhleeq mein tabdili nahi hogi, yahi seedha mustahkam Deen hai (jiski insani fitrat amanat daar hai.)"
"6758","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi wilaadat paaney wala nahi magar wo fitrat hi par paida hua hai, phir uske waalidain usey yahudi, nasrani aur mushrik bana detey hain. aik aadmi ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! agar wo us se pahley mar jaaey? aap ne farmaya : Allah hi zyada jaanney wala hai ke (badey ho kar) wo bachchey kya amal karne waley they."
"6759","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Kuraib ne hamein hadis bayan ki, donon ne kaha : hamein abu-Muawia ne hadis bayan ki, neez hamein ibne-Numair ne bhi (yahi) hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein mere walid ne hadis bayan ki, (abu-Muawia aur ibne-Numair ke walid ( donon ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki. ibne-Numair ki hadis mein hai : koi bachcha paida honey wala bachcha nahi magar wo millat par hota hai. aur abu-Muawia se Abu-Bakar ne jo riwayat ki usmein hai : magar wo us millat (millate-Islami) par hota hai yahan tak ke uski zaban us (ke kufr ya emaan) ko bayan kar deti hai. aur abu-Muawia se abu-Kuraib ki riwayat mein hai : koi wilaadat paaney wala nau-maulood nahi magar wo usi fitrat par hota hai yahan tak ke uski zaban uske (maahaul se akhaz karda) khayalat ki tarjamani karti hai."
"6760","Mamar ne hamein Hammam-bin-Munabba se hadis bayan ki, kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sunain, phir unhon-ne kai hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik hadis ye hai : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo ( bachcha ( paida hota hai, wo usi fitrat par paida hota hai, phir iske waalidain usko Yahudi aur nasrani bana detey hain jis tarah tum oonton ke bachchon ko janm dilwaatey ho. kya tum unmein se kisi ko kaan kata hua patey ho? yahan tak ke tum khud uska kaan kaat do, logon ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! kya aap ne dekha ke agar wo chhota hi faut ho jaaey? farmaya : Allah hi zyada jaanney wala hai. wo (chhoti umr mein faut hone-waale bachchey) kya amal karne waley they?"
"6761","Alaa ke walid Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : har insan ko uski maan fitrat par janm deti hai aur uske maan-baap baad mein usko Yahudi ya nasrani ya majusi bana detey hain. agar wo donon (sahi) musalman hon to wo musalman rehta hai aur har insan ko jab uski maan janm deti hai to shaitan iske donon pahluon mein hath se maarta hai siwaey Hazrat Maryam (Alaihissalam) aur unke betey ke (unhein Allah ne us se mehfooz rakha.)"
"6762","ibne-abi-Zi'ib aur Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yazeed se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mushrekeen ki aulad ke barey mein sawal kiya gaya to aap ne farmaya : Allah hi zyada janta hai ke) badey ho kar) wo kya amal karne waley they."
"6763","Mamar, Shuaib aur Maaqil-bin-Ubaidullah ne Zohri se Yunus aur ibne-abi-Zi'ib ki sanad ke sath un donon ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, magar Shuaib aur Maaqil ki hadis mein (mushrekeen ki aulad ke bajaey) mushrekeen ke chhotey bachchon ke alfaz hain."
"6764","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mushrekeen ke bachchon ke barey mein sawal kiya gaya, unmein se jo chhoti umr mein faut ho jayen (to unka anjam kya hoga?) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala zyada janta hai ke wo kya amal karne waley they."
"6765","Saeed-bin-Jubair ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mushrekeen ke bachchon ke mutaalliq sawal kiya gaya to aap ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne jab unko paida kiya to wo zyada jaanney wala hai ke wo kya amal karne waley they."
"6766","Saeed-bin-Jubair ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis ladkey ko Hazrat khizr (Alaihissalam) ne qatl kya tha wo tabai taur par kaafir banaya gaya tha, agar wo zinda rehta to zabardasti apne maan-baap ko sarkashi aur kufr ki taraf ley jata."
"6805","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waala Allah farmata hai : mere barey mein mera banda jo guman karta hai main ( usko pura karne ke liye) uske paas hota hun. jab wo mujhey yad karta hai to main iske sath hota hun. agar wo mujhey apne dil mein yad karta hai to main usey dil mein yad karta hun aur agar wo mujhey ( bhari ( majlis mein yad karta hai to main unki majlis se achi majlis mein usey yad karta hun, agar wo aik baalisht mere qareeb aata hai to main aik hath iske qareeb jata hun aur agar wo aik hath mere qareeb aata hai to main donon hathon ki poori lambai ke barabar iske qareeb aata hun, agar wo mere paas chalta hua aata hai to main daudta hua uske paas jata hun."
"6806","abu-Muawia ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, aur unhon-ne ye bayan nahi kya ke agar wo aik hath mere qareeb aata hai to main donon hathon ki poori lambai ke barabar uske qareeb aata hun."
"6807","hamein Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se hadis bayan ki, kaha : ye hadison Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, phir unhon-ne bahut si hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik ye thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha : Allah Taala ne farmaya : jab banda aik baalisht ( badh kar) mere paas aata hai to main aik hath ( badh kar) uske paas jata hun aur jab wo aik hath ( badh kar) mere paas aata hai to main donon hathon ki lambai ke barabar ( badh kar) uske paas jata hun aur agar wo donon hathon ki lambai ke barabar badh kar mere paas aata hai to main uske paas pahunch jata hon, us se zyada tezi se aata hun."
"6808","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka ke aik rastey par chaley ja rahe they ke aap ka aik pahaad ke qareeb se guzar hua jis ko jamdaan kaha jata hai, aap ne farmaya : chaltey raho, ye Jumdaan hai. mufarridun (logon se alag ho kar tanha ho janey waale) bazi ley gaey. logon ne puchha : Allah ke rasool! mufarridun se kya murad hai? farmaya : kasarat se Allah ko yad karne waley (mard) aur Allah ko yad karne wali (auratein.)"
"6809","Amr Naqid, Zuhair-bin-Harab aur ibne-abi-Umar ne hamein Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz Amr ke hain. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne abu-Zinad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ke ninyaanwe naam hain, jisne unki hifazat ki wo jannat mein dakhil ho jaeyga aur Allah witr ( taaq ( hai, witr ko pasand karta hai. aur ibne-abi-Umar ki riwayat mein hai : jisne unko shumaar kya."
"6810","Mamar ne hamein Ayub se khabar di, unhon-ne Ibne-Sirin se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, neez ( Ayub ne) Hammam-bin-Munabba se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ke ninyaanwe, aik kam so naam hain, jisne un (sab) ko shumaar kya wo jannat mein dakhil hoga aur Hammam ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se mazeed ye bayan kya be-shak wo ( Allah ( taaq hai, taaq hi ko pasand karta hai."
"6811","Abdul-Azeez bin Suheb ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tak tum mein se koi shakhs dua karey to qataeyat ke sath (israar kartey huey) dua karey aur ye na kahey : aey Allah! agar to chahey to mujhey de dey, kyonke Allah ko majbur karne wala koi nahi hai."
"6812","Alaa ke walid ( Abdur-Rehman ( ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs dua karey to ye na kahey : aey Allah! agar to chahey to mujhey bakhsh de, balke wo pukhtagi aur israar se sawal karey aur badi raghbat ka izhar karey, kyonke dene ke liye Allah Taala ke liye koi cheez badi nahi hai."
"6813","Ata-bin Mina ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs is tarah na kahey : aey Allah ! agar to chahey to mujhey bakhsh de, aey Allah! agar to chahey to mujh par raham farma. wo dua mein pukhtagi aur qataeyat se kaam ley kyonke Allah jo chahey wahi karta hai, koi nahi jo usey majbur kar sakey."
"6814","Abdul-Azeez ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs kisi nuqsan (museebat) ki wjah se, jo is par nazil ho, maut ki tamanna na kare. agar us ne laa-muhaala maut maangni bhi ho to yun kahey : aey Allah ! mujhey us waqt tak zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho aur mujhey wafat de jab maut mere liye behtar ho."
"6815","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : kisi nuqsan ki wjah se jo usey pahunchey. (nazil ho nahi kaha)"
"6816","Aasim ne hamein nazar bin Anas se hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) un dinon zinda they. ( nazar ne) kaha : Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : agar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya na hota : tum mein se koi shakhs maut ki tamanna na karey to main maut ki tamanna karta."
"6817","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Ismail bin abi Khalid se, unhon-ne Qais-bin abi Hazim se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne kaha : ham Hazrat Khabbaab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey, us waqt unke pet par (ilaaj ke liye) saat jagah (tapti hui dhaat se) dagh lagaey gaey they. unhon-ne kaha : agar ye na hota ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein maut ki dua se mana farmaya tha, to main us (maut) ki dua karta."
"6818","Sufiyan-bin-Uena, Jarir bin abdul-hameed, Wakee, Abdullah-bin-Numair, Motamir bin Sulaiman aur abu-Usama sab ne Ismail se isi sanad ke sath (yahi) riwayat ki."
"6819","Mamar ne hamein Hammam-bin-Munabba se hadis bayan ki, kaha : ye hadison hamein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, unhon-ne kai hadisein bayan kin, unmein se ye ( bhi) thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs hargiz maut ki tamanna na karey, na maut aaney se pahley uske liye dua karey kyonke jab tum mein se koi shakhs mar gaya to uska amal munqata ho gaya (mazeed amal ki mohlat khatm ho gai) aur momin ki umr uski bhalai hi mein izafa karti hai."
"6820","Hammam ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah se milney ko mahboob rakhey, Allah us se milney ko mehbub rakhta hai aur jo Allah se milney ko na-pasand karey, Allah bhi us se milney ko na-pasand karta hai."
"6821","Shoba ne Qatada se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko Hazrat Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6822","Khalid-bin Haris Hujaimi ne kaha : hamein Saeed ne Qatada se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne zuraarah se, unhon-ne Sad bin Hisham se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko pasand karey, Allah us se mulaqat ko pasand farmata hai aur jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand karey, Allah us se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai. maine kaha : Allah ke Nabi! kya us se maut ki na-pasandidgi murad hai? ham mein se har shakhs (taban) maut ko na-pasand karta hai, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye baat nahi hai, lekin jab momin ko Allah ki rehmat, uski razaamandi aur jannat ki basharat di jati hai to wo Allah se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai aur kaafir ko jab Allah ke azab aur uski naaraazagi ki khabar di jati hai to wo Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai aur Allah bhi us ( naa-shukrey aur mutakabbir ( se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai."
"6823","Muhammad-bin-Bakr ne kaha : hamein Saeed ne Qatada se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki."
"6824","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne Zakariya se, unhon-ne Shabi se, unhon-ne Shureh bin Hani se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai, Allah us se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai aur jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai, Allah bhi us se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai aur maut Allah ki mulaqat se pahley hai. ( mulaqat ka mamla iske baad aayega .)"
"6825","Esa-bin-Yonus ne kaha : hamein Zakariya ne Aamir (Shabi) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey shuraih bin Hani ne hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, usi (guzishta riwayat) ki tarah ."
"6826","absar ne Mutarrif se, unhon-ne Aamir se, unhon-ne shureh-bin-Hani se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko pasand karey, Allah us se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai aur jo Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand karey, Allah us se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai. (shureh-bin-Hani ne) kaha : main Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas hazir hua aur kaha : Ummul-Momenin ! maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik hadis bayan kartey huey suna, agar wo isi tarah hai (jis tarah wo bayan kartey hain) to ham halaak ho gaey. to unhon (Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ( ne farmaya : halaak honey wala waqei wahi hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qaul se halaak hua. ( bataao ( wo kya hadis hai? ( maine kaha : ( unhon-ne kaha hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai Allah bhi us se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai aur jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai, Allah bhi us se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai aur ham mein aisa koi nahi jo maut ko na-pasand na karta ho. to Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi farmaya tha, lekin (mafhoom ke eitibaar se) jis taraf tum gaey ho wo baat is tarah nahi balke (wo is tarah hai ke) jab nigaah uper ki taraf uth jati hai aur seeney mein saans ukhad rahi hoti hai aur jild par raungtey khadey ho jatey hain aur ungliyan tedhii ho kar akad jati hain to us waqt jo Allah se milney ko pasand karta hai, Allah bhi us se milnaa pasand karta hai. aur jo (us waqt) Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hai, Allah bhi us se milnaa na-pasand karta hai."
"6827","Jarir ne Mutarrif se isi sanad ke sath absar ki hadis ki tarah khabar di."
"6828","Hazrat abu-Musa Ash'ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko pasand karey, Allah bhi us se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai aur jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand karey, Allah bhi us se milney ko na-pasand karta hai."
"6829","Yazeed-bin-Asamm ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala farmata hai : mera banda mere barey mein jo guman karta hai, main ( usko pura karne ke liye) uske paas hota hun aur jab wo mujhey pukarta hai to main uske sath hota hun."
"6830","Yahya-bin-Saeed aur ibne-abi-Adi ne Sulaiman Taimi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waala Allah farmata hai : jab mera banda aik baalisht mere qareeb aata hai to main aik hath uske qareeb aata hun. aur jab wo aik hath mere qareeb aata hai to main donon hathon ki lambai ke barabar uske qareeb aata hun. aur jab wo chal kar mere paas aata hai to main daud kar uske paas jata hun."
"6831","Moatamir ne apne walid (Sulaiman Taimi) se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur jab wo chal kar mere paas aata hai to main daud kar uske paas jata hun zikr nahi kiya."
"6832","Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waala Allah farmata hai : mera banda mere barey mein jo guman karta hai to main ( usko pura karne ke liye) uske paas hota hun. aur jab wo mujhey yad karta hai to main uske sath hota hon, agar wo mujhey apne dil mein yad karta hai to main usey apne dil mein yad karta hun. agar wo mujhey kisi majlis mein yad karta hai to main un logon ki majlis se behtar majlis mein usko yad karta hun. aur agar wo aik baalisht mere qareeb hota hai to main aik hath uske qareeb ho jata hon, agar wo aik hath mere qareeb hota hai to main phailey huey donon hathon ki lambai jitna ( fasla ( uske qareeb ho jata hun. aur agar wo chal kar meri taraf aata hai to main daud kar uske paas aata hun."
"6833","Wakee ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne Ma'roor-bin-Suwed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waala Allah farmata hai : jo shakhs aik neki lekar aata hai, usey us jaisi das milti hain aur main badha (bhi) deta hun. aur jo shakhs burai lekar aata hai to uska badla us jaisi aik burai hai ya (chaahoon to) maaf kar deta hun. jo aik baalisht mere qareeb hota hai to main aik hath uske qareeb ho jata hun aur jo aik hath mere qareeb hota hai to main do hathon ke phailaao jitna uske qareeb ho jata hun. aur jo mere paas chalta hua aata hai, main uske paas daudta hua jata hun. aur jo mujh se poori zamin ki wusat bhar gunahon ke sath mulaqat karta hai (aur) mere sath kisi cheez ko Sharik nahi thahrata, main itni hi maghfirat ke sath us se mulaqat karta hun. (Imam Muslim ke shagird ( Ibrahim ne kaha : ham se Hasan-bin-Bishr ne, unko Wakee ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"6834","abu-Muawia ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : uske liye us jaisi das nekiyan milti hain, ya main (is se bhi) zyada deta hun."
"6835","Muhammad-bin-abu-Adi ne Humaid se, unhon-ne Sabit se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon mein se aik aisey shakhs ki iyaadat ki jo laaghir ho kar choozey ki tarah ho gaya tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : kya tum Allah Taala se kisi cheez ki dua kartey they ya us se kuchh maangtey they? usne kaha : ji haan , main kehta tha : aey Allah ! to mujhey aakhirat mein jo saza dene wala hai abhi duniya hi mein de dey. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah paak hai ! tum mein uski taqat nahi hai. ya ( farmaya : ( tum uski istitaat nahi rakhtey. tum ne ye kyon na kaha : aey Allah ! hamein duniya mein bhi achchhai ata farma aur aakhirat mein bhi achchhai ata farma aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha ley. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske liye Allah se dua farmai to usne is shakhs ko shifa ata farma di."
"6836","Khalid-bin-Haaris ne kaha : hamein Humaid ne isi sanad ke sath dua ki in alfaz tak hadis bayan ki : hamein dozakh ke azab se bacha aur us se izaafi baat bayan nahi ki."
"6837","Hammad ne kaha : Sabit ne hamein Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sahaba mein se aik shakhs ki iyaadat ke liye tashrif le gaey, wo choozey ki tarah ( laaghir (ho gaya tha. iske baad Humaid ki hadis ke ham mana hai, magar unhon-ne is tarah kaha : tum mein Allah ka azab bardasht karne ki taqat nahi. unhon-ne ye bayan nahi kiya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske liye Allah se dua ki to usne is shakhs ko shifa ata farma di."
"6838","Qatada ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis bayan ki."
"6839","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : Allah tabarak w taala ke kuchh Farishtey hain jo (Allah ki zamin mein) chakkar lagaatey rahtey hain. wo Allah ke zikr ki majlisein talash kartey hain. jab wo koi aisi majlis patey hain jis mein (Allah ka ( zikr hota hai to unke sath baith jatey hain, wo aik doosrey ko apne paron se is tarah dhanp letey hain ke apne aur duniya ke aasman ke darmyan (ki wusat ko) bhar detey hain. jab ( majlis mein Sharik hone-waale ( log muntashir (bikhar) ho jatey hain to ye ( Farishtey ( bhi uper ki taraf jatey hain aur aasman par chaley jatey hain, kaha : to izzat aur jalaal waala Allah unse poochhta hai, halanke wo unke barey mein sabse zyada jaanney wala hai : tum kahan se aaey ho? wo kehtey hain : ham zamin main ( rehney waale) terey bandon ki taraf se (ho kar) aaey hain jo teri pakeezgi bayan kar rahe they, teri badaai keh rahe they aur sirf aur sirf terey hi maabood honey ka iqrar kar rahe they aur teri hamd aur sana kar rahe they aur tujhii se maang rahe they. farmaya : wo mujh se kya maang rahe they? unhon-ne kaha : wo aap se aap ki jannat maang rahe they. farmaya : kya unhon-ne meri jannat dekhi hai? unhon-ne kaha : parwardigar ! ( unhon-ne ( nahi ( dekhi ). farmaya : agar unhon-ne meri jannat dekhi hoti kya hota ! (kaisey ro-ro kar aur gid-gida kar maangtey ! ( wo kehtey hain : aur wo teri panah maang rahe they, farmaya : wo kis cheez se meri panah maang rahe they? unhon-ne kaha : teri aag (jahannam ( se, aey rab! farmaya : kya unhon-ne meri aag (jahannam) dekhi hai? unhon-ne kaha : aey rab ! nahi ( dekhi ( , farmaya : agar wo meri jahannam dekh letey to ( unka kya haal hota ! ( wo kehtey hain : wo tujh se gunahon ki bakhshish maang rahe they, to wo farmata hai : maine unke gunah bakhsh diye aur unhon-ne jo maanga maine unhein ata kar diya aur unhon-ne jis se panah mangi maine unhein panah de di. ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) farmaya : wo ( Farishtey ( kehtey hain : parwardigar ! unmein falan shakhs bhi maujood tha, sakht gunahgaar banda , wahan se guzartey huey unke sath baith gaya tha. (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) farmaya : to Allah irshad farmata hai : maine usko bhi bakhsh diya. ye aisey log hain ke unki wjah se unke sath baith janey wala bhi mahroom nahi rehta."
"6840","Abdul-Azeez-bin-Suhaib ne kaha : Qatada ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kon si dua kasarat se maanga kartey they? Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kasarat se jo dua maanga kartey they wo ye thi ke aap kehtey : aey Allah ! hamein duniya mein bhi achchhai ata farma, aakhirat mein bhi acchhhai ata farma aur hamein aag ke azab se mehfooz rakh. kaha : Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) jab koi aik dua maangna chahtey to yahi dua maangtey aur jab badi dua maangna chahtey to usmein ye dua bhi maangtey."
"6841","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( dua farmatey huey ye ( kaha kartey they : aey hamarey rab ! hamein duniya mein bhi achchhai ata farma aur aakhirat mein bhi achchhai ata farma aur hamein dozakh ke azab se bacha."
"6842","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs din mein sau martaba :                                                                                                                                                  (لا اله الا الله وحده لا شريك له له الملك وله لحمد وهو على كل شيء قدير)                                                                                                             '' Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi, wo akelaa hai, uska koi Sharik nahi, saari badhshahat usi ki hai, hamd sirf usi ke layeq hai aur wahi har cheez par qaadir hai.''                                                                                                                            kahey: us shakhs ko das ghulam aazad karne ke barabar ajr milta hai, uske liye so nekiyan likhi jati hain, uske sau gunah mitaa diye jatey hain aur ye kalimaat Sham tak pura din shaitan se uski hifazat ka zariya bin jati hain aur koi shakhs is se zyada afzal amal nahi kar sakta , siwaey us shakhs ke jo us se bhi zyada martaba yahi amal karey aur jis shakhs ne aik din mein sau martaba (سبحان الله وبحمده) kaha to iske tamam gunah maaf kar diye jatey hain, chahey wo samandar ke jhaag ke barabar hon."
"6843","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi shakhs jab subah karey aur jab Sham karey to sau baar (سبحان الله وبحمده) kahey to qiyamat ke roz koi shakhs us se behtar amal lekar nahi aayega , siwaey uske jo itni baar (ye kalimaat ( kahey ya us se zyada baar kahey ."
"6846","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : do kalimey hain jo zaban par halkey hain aur meezaan mein bhari hain aur Allah ko bahut mahboob hain :                      (سبحان الله وبحمده سبحان اللہ العظيم ) Allah har us cheez se paak hai jo uske shaayaan shaan nahi aur sab hamd usi ke layaq hai, Allah har us cheez se paak hai jo uske shaayaane-shaan nahi aur azmat ki har sifat se bhara hai."
"6847","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye baat ke main ( سبحان الله والحمدلله wla اله الا لله Allah ki qism اکبر) kahun , mujhey un tamam chizon se zyada mahboob hai jin par suraj tuloo hota hai."
"6848","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Ali-bin-Mus-hir aur ibne-Numair ne Musa Johni se hadis bayan ki, aur hamein Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Numer ne bhi yahi hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz unhi ke hain. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : hamein mere walid ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Musa Johni ne Musab-bin-Sad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : aik dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha : mujhey kuchh kalimaat sikhaaiye jinhein main (bataur zikr) kaha karun. aap ne farmaya : ye kaha karo : (لا اله الا لله وحده لا شريك له اللہ اکبر كبيرا والحمدلله كثيرا وسبحان الله رب العالمين لا حول wla قوة الا بالله العزيز الحكيم) Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi Sharik nahi, Allah badaai mein sabse bada hai aur behad w hisab tareef Allah ki hai, Allah har us cheez se paak hai jo iske shaayane-shaan nahi, wo sarey jahaanon ka paalne wala hai, kisi mein burai se bachney ki taqat aur neki karne ki quwwat nahi magar sirf aur sirf Allah ki di hui jo sab par ghalib hai, badi hikmat wala hai. us shakhs ne kaha : ye kalimaat to mere rab ke liye hain, mere liye kya hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye kaho : ( اللهم اغفرلى وارحمنى واهدنى وارزقنى (aey Allah ! mujhey bakhsh de, mujh par raham farma, mujhey hidayat de aur mujhey rizq ata farmaa. Musa ne kaha : jahan tak ( عافنى ( mujhey aafiyat ata kar ka talluq hai to iske barey mein mujhey thoda sa waham hai aur mujhey yaqin nahi hai, aur ibne-Abi-Sheba ne apni hadis mein Musa ka ye qaul naql nahi kya."
"6849","abdul-Wahid bin Ziyad ne kaha : hamein abu-Malik Ashjai ne apne walid (taariq bin Ashim Ashjai (Raziallahu anhu)) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : jo shakhs Islam qabool karta, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usko un kalimaat ki taleem detey they : ( اللهم اغفرلى وارحمنى واهدنى وارزقنى ( Allah ! mujhey bakhsh de, mujh par raham farma, mujhey hidayat de aur mujhey rizq ata farma."
"6850","abu-Muawia ne kaha : hamein abu-Malik Ashjai ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki, kaha : jab koi shakhs musalman hota to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usko Namaz sikhatey, phir usko hukm detey ke un kalimaat ke sath dua kya karey : ( اللهم اغفرلى وارحمنى واهدنى وعافنى وارزقنى) ."
"6851","Yazid-bin-Harun ne kaha : abu-Malik ne hamein apne walid se khabar di ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, (is waqt) unke paas aik shakhs ne hazir ho kar kaha : Allah ke rasool! jab main apne rab se maangon to kya kaha karun? aap ne farmaya : tum kaho : ( اللهم اغفرلى وارحمنى واهدنى وعافنى وارزقنى) sath hi apne angoothey ke siwa (eik aik karke ( saari ungliyan band kartey gaey (aur farmaya : ( ye kalimaat tumharey liye tumhari duniya aur aakhirat donon jama kar dengey."
"6852","Musab bin Sad se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey mere walid (Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir they ke aap ne farmaya : kya tum mein se koi shakhs is baat se aajiz hai ke har roz aik hazaar nekiyan kamaaey? aap ke sath baithey huey logon mein se aik ne puchha ham mein se koi shakhs aik hazaar nekiyan kis tarah kamaa sakta hai? aap ne farmaya : wo so baar subhanallah kahey. uske liye hazaar nekiyan likh di jaeyngi aur uske hazaar gunah mitaa diye jaengey."
"6853","abu-Muawia ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne kisi musalman ki duniyawi takleefon mein se koi takleef door ki, Allah Taala uski qiyamat ki takleefon mein se koi takleef door karega. aur jis shakhs ne kisi tang dast ke liye aasani ki, Allah Taala uske liye duniya aur aakhirat mein aasani karega. aur jisne kisi musalman ki parda poshi ki, Allah Taala duniya aur aakhirat mein uski parda poshii karega. aur Allah Taala us waqt tak bandey ki madad mein laga rehta hai jab tak banda apne bhai ki madad mein laga rehta hai aur jo shakhs us rastey par chalta hai jis mein wo ilm hasil karna chahta hai to Allah Taala iske zariey se uske liye jannat ka rasta aasan kar deta hai. Allah ke gharon mein se kisi ghar mein logon ka koi giroh ikattha nahi hota, wo Quran ki tilawat kartey hain aur uska dars aur tadrees kartey hain magar un par sakeenat ( itminan aur sukoon qalb (ka nuzool hota hai aur) Allah ki) rehmat unko dhanp leti hai aur Farishtey unko apne gherey mein ley letey hain aur Allah Taala apne muqarrebeen (qareebon) mein jo uske paas hotey hain unka zikr karta hai aur jiske amal ne usey ( khair ke husool mein) peechhey rakha , uska nasb usey tez nahi kar sakta."
"6854","Abdullah-bin-Numair aur abu-Usama ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jis tarah abu-Muawia ki hadis hai, magar abu-Usama ki hadis mein tangdast ke liye aasani karne ka zikr nahi."
"6857","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) nikal kar masjid mein aik halqey ( walon (ke paas se guzrey , unhon-ne kaha : tumhen kis cheez ne yahan bitha rakha hai? unhon-ne kaha : ham Allah ka zikr karne ke liye baithey hain. unhon-ne kaha : kya Allah ko gawah bana kar kehtey ho ke tumhen iske ilawa aur kisi gharaz ne nahi bithaya? unhon-ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! ham iske alawa aur kisi wjah se nahi baithey, unhon-ne kaha : dekho , maine tum par kisi tohmat ki wjah se qism nahi di. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney meri haisiyat ka koi shakhs aisa nahi jo hadis bayan karne mein mujh se kam ho, (iske bawajud apne yaqeeni ilm ki bina par main tumharey samney ye hadis bayan kar raha hun ke) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikal kar apne sathiyon ke aik halqey ke qareeb tashrif laey aur farmaya : tum kis gharaz se baithey ho? unhon-ne kaha : ham baithey Allah ka zikr kar rahe hain aur is baat par uski hamd kar rahe hain ke usne Islam ki taraf hamari rehnumai ki. iske zariey se ham par ehsan kiya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya tum Allah ko gawah bana kar kehtey ho ke tum sirf isi gharaz se baithey ho? unhon-ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! ham iske siwa aur kisi gharaz se nahi baithey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maine tum par kisi tohmat ki wjah se tumhen qism nahi di, balke mere paas Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aaey aur mujhey bataya ke Allah Taala tumharey zariey se farishton ke samney fakhr ka izhar farma raha hai."
"6858","Sabit ne abu-Burda se aur unhon-ne Hazrat agral mazni (Raziallahu anhu) se, jinhein sharfe-sohbat hasil tha, riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere dil par ghubaar sa chhaa jata hai to main (is kaifiyat ke izaaley (khatmey) ke liye) aik din mein sau baar Allah se istighfar karta hun."
"6859","ghandar ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Umra-bin-murraa se aur unhon-ne abu-Burda se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Aghrarr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna. padhi. aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se they. wo Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey they, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : logo ! Allah ki taraf tauba kiya karo kyonke main Allah se. aik din mein sau baar tauba karta hun."
"6860","Ubaidullah ke walid Muaz , Abu-Dawud aur Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Shoba se isi sanad se ( yahi ( riwayat ki."
"6861","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne suraj ke maghrib se tuloo honey se pahley tauba kar li, Allah Taala uski tauba ko qabool farma lega ."
"6862","Muhammad-bin-Fuzail aur abu-Muawia ne Aasim se, unhon-ne abu-Usman se aur unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik safar mein ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they ke log buland awaz ke sath Allahu-akbar kehney lagey, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aey logo ! apni jaanon par narmi karo, tum na kisi behrey ko pukar rahe ho, na ghayab ko , tum usko pukar rahe ho jo har waqt khub sunney wala hai, qareeb hai aur tumharey sath hai. us waqt mein aap ke peechhey tha aur ye keh raha tha : (لا حول wla قوة الا بالله ) gunahon se bchney aur neki ki quwwat sirf aur sirf Allah se miltii hai. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Abdullah-bin-Qais ! kya main tumhen jannat ke khazaanon mein se aik khazaaney ka pata na bataan? maine kaha : kyon nahi, Allah ke rasool! aap ne farmaya : (لا حول wla قوة الا بالله ) kaha karo."
"6863","Hafs bin Ghiyas ne Aasim se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6864","Yazeed bin Zure ne kaha : hamein (Sulaiman) Taimi ne abu-Usman se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke wo log ( sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu)) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they aur wo aik ghaati par chadh rahe they, kaha : aik aadmi jab bhi oonchaai par chadhta zor se pukaarna shuru kar deta : (لا اله الا لله Allah ki qism اکبر) ( abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum log kisi behrey ko ya usey jo ghayab ho, nahi pukar rahe. kaha : phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : abu-Musa ! ya ( farmaya : ( Abdullah-bin-Qais ! kya tumhen aisa kalima na bataaun jo jannat ke khazaaney mein se hai? maine arz ki, Allah ke rasool! wo kya hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (لا حول wla قوة الا بالله) (gunahon se bchney ki) koi koshish aur (neki karne ki) koi quwwat Allah ke siwa kisi se hasil nahi hoti."
"6865","Motamir ne apne walid (Sulaiman Taimi) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein abu-Usman ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik baar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) phir usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah bayan kya."
"6866","Ayub ne abu-Usman se aur unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein they, phir Aasim ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya."
"6867","Khalid Haza ne abu-Usman se aur unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham aik ghazwey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, phir us hadis ko bayan kya aur is mein kaha : (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( tum jisko pukar rahe ho wo tum mein se kisi ki ontni ki gardan ki nisbat bhi iske zyada qareeb hai. aur un ( Khalid Haza ( ki hadis main ( لا حول wla قوة الا بالله ) ka zikr nahi hai."
"6868","Usmaan-bin-Ghiyaas ne kaha : hamein abu-Usman ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah ne mujh se farmaya : kya main tumhen jannat ke khazaanon mein se aik kalima na bataaun? . padhi. ya farmaya : . padhi. jannat ke khazaanon mein se aik khazaaney ka pata na bataaun? maine kaha : kyon nahi (zaroor bataein) , Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (لا حول wla قوة الا بالله )"
"6869","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya : ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey aik dua sikhlaaiye jis ko main padha karun apni Namaz mein. Aap ne farmaya ye kaha kar ya Allah maine apne nafs par bada zulm kya hai ya bahut zulm kya hai aur gunahon ko koi nahi bakhshtaa siwa terey, to bakhsh de mujhey apne paas ki bakhshish se aur raham kar mujh par to bakhshney wala meharban hai."
"6870","Abdullah-bin Wahab ne hamein khabar di, kaha : hamein aik aadmi ne jiska unhon-ne naam liya aur Amr-bin-Haris ne Yazeed bin abi Habib se khabar di aur unhon-ne abul-Khair se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey they : Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : Allah ke rasool! aap mujhey aik aisi dua sikhaaiye jisko main apni Namaz mein bhi maanga karun aur apne ghar mein bhi maanga karun. padhi. phir Leis ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya. magar unhon-ne (baghair shak ke) (zulman kaseera) ( bahut zulm kya ( kaha,"
"6871","ibne-Numair ne kaha : hamein Hisham ne apne walid ( Urwa ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( Allah Taala se) ye duaein maanga kartey they : aey Allah ! main teri panah mein aata hun aag ke fitney se aur aag ke azab se aur ghina ki aazmaish ke shar se aur faqr ki aazmaish ke shar se aur main teri panah mein aata hun jhootey Masih ke fitney ki burai se. aey Allah! meri khataein barf aur olon (ke pani ( se dho de, aur mere dil ko khataaon se is tarah saaf suthra kar de jis tarah to safaid kapdey ko mail se saaf karta hai aur mere aur meri khataaon ke darmyan itna fasla daal de jitna fasla tu ney mashriq aur maghrib ke darmyan daala hai. aey Allah ! main susti, aajiz kar dene waley budhapey, gunah aur qarz (ke ghalbey) se teri panah mein aata hun."
"6872","abu-Muawia aur Wakee ne hamein Hisham se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki."
"6873","ibne-Ulaih ne kaha : hamein Sulaiman Taimi ne khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua farmaya kartey they : aey Allah ! main aajiz honey, susti, buzdili, budhapey aur kanjoosi se teri panah mein aata hun aur main qabr ke azab aur zindagi aur maut ki aazmaaishon se teri panah mein aata hun."
"6874","Yazeed bin Zure aur Motamir donon ne Taimi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, albatta Yazeed ki hadis mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaul : aur zindagi aur maut ki aazmaaishon se (main teri panah mein aata hun) mazkoor nahi."
"6875","ibne-Mubarak ne Sulaiman Taimi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kai cheezon se, jinka unhon-ne zikr kya aur kanjoosi se Allah ki panah talab ki."
"6876","Shuaib bin Habhaab ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye duaein maanga kartey they : aey Allah! main kanjoosi, susti, zaleel tareen Umar, qabr ke azab aur zindagi aur maut ki aazmaaishon se teri panah mein aata hun."
"6877","Amr Naqid aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne mujhey hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Sumai ne Abu-Saleh se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) insan ke haq mein bura Sabit hone-waale faisley , bad-bakhtii ke aa leney , apni takleef par dushmanon ke khush honey aur aajiz kar dene wali aazmaish se panah maanga kartey they. Amr ne apni hadis (ki sanad) mein kaha : Sufiyan ne kaha : mujhey shak hai ke) shayad ( maine un baton mein se koi aik baat badha di hai."
"6878","Leis ne Yazeed bin abi Habib se aur unhon-ne Haris bin Yaqoob se riwayat ki ke Yaqoob-bin-Abdullah ne unhein hadis sunai, unhon-ne Basar-bin-Saeed ko ye kehtey huey suna, maine Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna, kaha : maine Hazrat Khaula binte- hakeem salmiya (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehti thin : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jo shakhs kisi ( bhi) manzil par utra aur us ne ye kalimaat kahey : main Allah (se us) ke mukammal tareen kalimaat ki panah talab karta hun har us cheez ke shar se jo usney paida ki, to us shakhs ko us manzil se chaley janey tak koi cheez nuqsan nahi pahunchaaeygi."
"6880","Yaqoob ne kaha : qaqa-bin-Hakim ne Zakwan se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne kaha : aik shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! mujhey us bichhu se kitni shadeed takleef pahunchi jisne kal raat mujhey kaat liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar tumne jab raat ki thi, ye (kalimaat) keh detey : main har us cheez ke shar se jisey Allah ne paida kya, iske kaamil tareen kalimaat ki panah mein aata hun to wo ( bichhu) tumhen koi nuqsan na pahunchata ."
"6881","Leis ne Yazeed bin abi Habib se, unhon-ne Jafar se, unhon-ne Yaqoob se riwayat ki, unhon-ne unko bataya ke Ghatfan ke aazad karda ghulam Abu-Saleh ne unhein bataya, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, kehtey they aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! mujhey bichhu ne kaat liya. (aagey) ibne-Wahab ki hadis ki tarah hai."
"6882","Mansoor ne Sad bin Ubeda se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum apne bistar par janey lago to apni Namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu karo, phir apni daain karwat leto , phir ye kaho : aey Allah! maine apna chehra terey sipurd kar diya aur apna mamla terey hawale kar diya aur apni kamar terey sahaarey par tika di, ye sab tujh se ummeed aur terey khof ke sath kya. terey siwa tujh se na kahin panah mil sakti hai, na nijat hasil ho sakti hai. main teri kitab par eman laya jo tuney nazil ki aur terey Nabi par eman laya jisey tuney maboos kya. un kalimaat ko tum (apni zaban se ada hone-waale) aakhiri kalimaat bana lo (unke baad aur kuchh na bolo) to us raat agar tumhen maut aa gaee to fitrat par maut aaeygii. (hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : maine un kalimaat ko yad karne ke liye unhein dohraya to kaha : main terey rasool par eman laya jisey tuney bheja to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( yun ( kaho : main terey Nabi par eman laya jisey tuney bhejaa."
"6883","Husain ne Sad bin Ubeda se, unhon-ne Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis riwayat ki, magar Mansoor ne zyada mukammal hadis bayan ki aur Husain ki hadis mein ye izafa kya : agar ye ( kehney wala ( subah karega to khair hasil karega ."
"6884","Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne Abu-Dawud se aur ibne-Bashar ne Abdur-Rehman aur Abu-Dawud donon se riwayat ki, donon ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Amr-bin-Murra se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Sad-bin-Ubaida se suna, wo Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko hukm diya ke jab wo raat ko apni khuwab gaah mein janey lagey to ( dua kartey huey) ye kahey : aey Allah ! maine apni jaan terey sipurd kar di aur apna chehra teri taraf mutwajjeh kar liya aur apni kamar terey sahaarey par tika di aur apna mamla terey hawale kar diya, ye sab tujhi se ummeed kartey huey aur tujhi se dartey huey kya. tujh se khud terey siwa na panah ki koi jagah hai na nijat ki. main teri kitab par eman laya jo tuney nazil ki aur terey rasool par eman laya jisey tuney bheja, phir agar (is raat) usey maut aa gaee to fitrat par maut aaeygi. ibne-Bashar ne apni hadis mein : raat ke waqt (bistar par janey lagey) ke alfaz nahi kahey."
"6885","abu-Ahwas ne Abu-Ishaq se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs se farmaya : aey falan! jab tum apne bistar par letney lago. iske baad Amr-bin-Murra ki hadis ki tarah hai. ( magar abu-Ahwas ne Mansoor ki riwayat ki tarah) ye alfaz kahey : (aur mein eman laya) terey Nabi par jisey tuney bheja, phir agar tum us raat mar gaey to (theek) fitrat par marogey aur agar tum ne ( zinda haalat mein) subah kar li to khair ( w bhalai ( hasil karogey."
"6886","Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko hukm diya, usi ki tarah , aur unhon-ne agar tum ne ( zinda haalat mein) subah ki to khair hasil karogey ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"6887","Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab bistar par tashrif ley jatey to ye dua kartey : aey Allah! main terey naam se jeeta hun aur terey naam se wafat paaunga aur jab bedaar hotey to farmatey : Allah ki hamd hai jisne hamein wafat dene ke baad zinda kar diya aur usi ki taraf (qiyamat ke roz) zinda ho kar jana hai."
"6888","Aqba bin Mukarram aur Abu-Bakar bin Naafe ne kaha : hamein ghandar ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Khalid se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Abdullah-bin-Haaris ko Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey suna, unhon-ne aik shakhs se kaha ke jab wo apne bistar par jaey to ye dua karey : aey Allah ! meri jaan ko tuney paida kya aur tu hi usko maut dega, us jaan ki maut bhi aur zindagi bhi terey hi liye hai, agar to usko zinda rakhey to uski hifazat farmana aur agar to usko maut de to uski maghfirat karna, aey Allah ! main tujh se aafiyat mangta hun. aik shakhs ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : kya aap ne ye hadis Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suni hai? unhon-ne kaha : unse jo Hazrat umr se zyada afzal hain (maine ye hadis) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (suni hai.) ibne-Naafe ne apni riwayat mein kaha : Abdullah-bin-Haaris se riwayat hai, ye nahi kaha : maine suna."
"6889","Jarir ne Suhel se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : (mere walid) Abu-Saleh hamein hukm diya kartey they ke jab ham mein se koi shakhs soney ka irada karey to bistar par daain karwat letey, phir dua karey : aey Allah! aey aasmanon ke rab aur zamin ke rab aur arsh aur farsh ke rab, aey hamarey rab aur har cheez ke rab , daney aur guthliyon ko cheer ( kar paudey aur darakht ugaa ( dene waley ! Taurait , Injeel aur furqan ko nazil karne waley ! main har us cheez ke shar se teri panah mein aata hun jiski peshani terey qabzey mein hai, aey Allah! tu hi awwal hai, tujh se pahley koi cheez nahi, aey Allah! tu hi aakhir hai, terey baad koi cheez nahi hai, tu hi zahir hai, terey uper koi cheez nahi hai, tu hi baatin hai, tujh se peechhey koi cheez nahi hai, hamari taraf se (hamara) qarz ada kar aur hamein faqr se ghina ata farmaa. wo us hadis ko Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur wo ( aagey ( usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kartey they."
"6890","Khalid Tahan ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein ye hukm diya kartey they ke jab ham apne bistaron par letein to ye dua karein, Jarir ki hadis ki tarah (aur Khalid Tahan ne har us cheez ke shar se ke bajaey) kaha : har us jaandaar ke shar se (teri panah chahta hun) jisey tuney uski peshani se pakda hua hai."
"6891","Aamash ne Abu-Saleh se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik khaadim maangney ke liye aain to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (jawab mein) unse kaha : (beti!) tum kaha karo : aey Allah ! saaton aasmanon ke rab! jis tarah Suhel ne apne walid ( Abu-Saleh ( se riwayat ki."
"6892","Anas bin ayaaz ne kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Saeed bin abi Saeed Maqbari ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne bistar par letna chahey to apne tehband ka androoni hissey lekar us se apne bistar ko jhaadey, phir bismillaah kahey kyonke wo nahi janta ke us (ke uth janey) ke baad iske bistar par (makhlooqat mein se) kon aaya? phir jab letnaa chahey to apni daain karwat letey aur kahey : mere parwardigar ! to (har na-shaayaan baat se) paak hai, maine terey ( hukm ( se apna pahlu ( bistar par) rakha aur terey hi hukm se usey uthaaunga agar tu ney meri Rooh ko (apne paas) rok liya to uski maghfirat kar dena aur agar tuney usey ( wapas ( bhej diya to uski isi tarah hifazat farmana jis tarah to apne nek bandon ki hifazat farmata hai."
"6893","Abda ne Ubaidullah-bin-Umar se isi sanad ke sath yahi hadis riwayat ki aur kaha : phir wo ye hai : terey naam se aey parwardigar ! maine apna pahlu tikaaya , agar tuney meri jaan ko zinda kya to is par rehmat farmana."
"6894","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab bistar par jatey to farmatey : Allah Taala ki hamd hai jisne hamein khilaaya, pilaya, (har tarah se) kafi hua aur hamein thikana diya. kitney log hain jinka na koi kifaayat karne wala hai na thikana dene wala."
"6895","Mansoor ne Hilal se aur unhon-ne farwa bin Nofal Ashjai se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Ummul-Momenin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se sawal kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah Taala se kya duaein kya kartey they? Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dua kya kartey they : aey Allah ! jo maine kya uske shar se aur jo maine nahi kya, uske shar se teri panah mein aata hun."
"6896","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Husain se, unhon-ne Hilal se aur unhon-ne farwa bin Nofal se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se sawal kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kya dua farmaya kartey they? Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : aap ye dua farmaya kartey they : aey Allah ! maine jo kaam kiye hain, unke shar se aur jo kaam maine nahi kiye, unke shar se teri panah chahta hun."
"6897","ibne-abi Adi aur Muhammad-bin-Jafar donon ne Shoba se aur unhon-ne Husain se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki, magar Muhammad-bin-Jafar ki hadis main ( وشر ما لم ( aamal ke bajaey) (و من شر ما لم اعمل) hai."
"6898","Abda bin abu-Lubaba ne Hilaal-bin-Yasaaf se, unhon-ne Farwa bin Nofal se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni dua mein farmatey they : aey Allah ! main un kaamon ke shar se jo maine kiye aur unke shar se jo nahi kiye, teri panah mein aata hun."
"6899","Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (dua kartey huey) farmaya kartey they : aey Allah! main terey liye farmaanbardaar ho gaya, terey sath eman laya, tujh par bharosa kya, teri taraf ruju kya aur teri madad se (kufr ke saath) mukhaasimat ki. aey Allah! main is baat se teri izzat ki panah leta hun. padhi. terey siwa koi maabood nahi. padhi. ke to mujhey seedhi raah se hata de. padhi. tu hi hamesha zinda rehney wala hai jis ko maut nahi aa sakti aur jin w insan sab mar jaengey."
"6900","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi safar mein hotey aur sahar ke waqt uthtey to farmatey : ( hamari taraf se) Allah ki hamd aur uske inaam ki khoobsoorti (ke aetraaf) ka sunney wala ye baat dusron ko bhi suna de. aey hamarey rab! hamarey sath reh, ham par ehsan kar, main aag se Allah ki panah maangtey huey ye dua kar raha hun."
"6901","Muaz Anbari ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Barda bin abu-Musa Ash-ari se, unhon-ne apne walid Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ye dua farmaya kartey they : aey Allah ! meri khata meri la ilmi , apne ( kisi) mamley mein mera had se aagey ya peechhey reh jana aur wo sab kuchh jo meri nisbat to zyada janta hai sab maaf farma de. aey Allah ! mere wo sab kaam jo ( tujhey pasand na aaey hon ( maine sanjeedagi se kiye hon ya mazaahan kiye hon, bhool chook kar kiye hon ya jaan-bojh kar kiye hon aur ye sab mujh se huey hon, unko bakhsh de. aey Allah ! meri wo baatein (jo tujhey pasand nahi aaein ( bakhsh de jo maine pahley kiin ya jo maine baad mein kin, akeley mein kin ya jo maine sab ke samney kin aur jinhein to mujh se zyada jaanney wala hai, tu hi (jisey chahey apni rehmat ki taraf) aagey badhaney wala hai aur tu hi peechhey karne wala hai aur to har cheez par qaadir hai."
"6902","Abdul-Malik bin Sabaah Mismai ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne isi sanad se ( yahi ( hadis bayan ki."
"6903","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya kartey they : aey Allah ! mere Deen ko durust kar de, jo mere ( Deen w duniya ke) har kaam ke tahaffuz ka zaria hai aur meri duniya ko durust kar de jis mein meri guzraan hai aur meri aakhirat ko durust kar de jis mein mera (apni manzil ki taraf ( lautna hai aur meri zindagi ko mere liye har bhalai mein izaafey ka sabab bana de aur meri wafat ko mere liye har shar se raahat bana de."
"6904","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin Bishr ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis sunai, unhon-ne abu-Ahwas se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya kartey they : aey Allah ! main tujh se hidayat , taqwa , paak daamani, aur (dil ka ( ghinaa mangta hun."
"6905","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur ibne-Bashar ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Rehman ne Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Ishaq se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki, albatta ibne-Musanna ne apni riwayat main ((afaaf ( ki bajaey) iffat ka lafz kaha, (mafhoom aik hi hai.)"
"6906","Abdullah-bin-Haaris aur abu-Usmaan nehdi ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main tumhen isi tarah bataataa hun jis tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha, aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main tujh se teri panah mein aata hun, aajiz ho janey , sustii , buzdili, kanjoosi, sakht budhapey aur qabr ke azab se. aey Allah ! mere dil ko taqwa de, usko pakeeza kar de, tu hi us (dil) ko sabse behtar paak karne wala hai, tu hi iska rakhwaalaa aur iska madadgaar hai. aey Allah ! main tujh se aisey ilm se teri panah mangta hun jo koi fayda na de aur aisey dil se jo (terey aagey) jhuk kar mutmain na hota ho aur aisey man se jo sair na ho aur aisi dua se jisey sharfe-qabooliyat naseeb na ho."
"6907","abdul-Wahid-bin-Ziyad ne Hasan-bin-Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Ibrahim-bin-Sad Nakhai ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab Sham hoti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua kartey they : ham ne Sham ki aur Sara mulk (Sham ke waqt bhi) Allah ka hua, sab shukr aur tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi, wo akelaa ( Malik , maabood ( hai, uska koi Sharik nahi. Hasan (bin-Ubaidullah) ne kaha : mujhey Zaid ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne is (dua) mein (ye hissey ( Ibrahim ( Nakhai ( se ( sun kar) hifz kiya : usi ki baadshaahi aur usi ke liye har tarah ki tareef hai aur wo har cheez par poori tarah qaadir hai. aey Allah ! main tujh se us raat ki bhalai mangta hun aur tujh se us raat ki aur uske baad (ke har lamhey ( ki burai se panah talab karta hun, aey Allah ! main kasl mandi (sustee) aur budhapey ki kharabi se teri panah mein aata hon, aey Allah ! main teri panah mangta hun jahannam mein kisi bhi qism ke azab se aur qabr mein kisi bhi qism ke azab se."
"6908","Jarir ne Hasan-bin-Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Ibrahim-bin-Suwed se, unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Sham kartey to (dua kartey huey) farmatey : ham aur Sara mulk Sham ke waqt bhi Allah ka hua, sab hamd Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi, wo akelaa hai, uska koi Sharik nahi. (Hasan-bin-Ubaidullah ne) kaha : main dekhta hun ke unhon (Ibrahim Nakhai) ne un kalimaat mein ye bhi kaha : saari badhshahat usi ki hai, (har nemat par) saari tareef bhi usi ke qaabil hai, wahi har cheez par poori qudrat rakhney wala hai. aey mere parwardigar ! jo kuchh s raat mein hai aur jo iske baad hai, main tujh se uski bhalai ka talabgaar hun aur jo kuchh is raat mein hai aur jo iske baad hai uski burai se main teri panah mein aata hun. aey mere parwardigar ! main teri panah chahta hun kasl mandi (sustee) se aur budhapey ki kharabi se. aey mere parwardigar ! main tujh se panah mangta hun jahannam mein kisi bhi qism ke azab se aur qabr mein kisi bhi qism ke azab se. aur jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah kartey to (bilkul usi tarah) farmatey : ham aur saari badhshahat aur ikhtiyar subah ko (bhi) Allah ke huey."
"6909","Zayda ne Hasan-bin-Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Ibrahim-bin-Suwaid se, unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sham ke waqt ( dua kartey huey ye ( farmaya kartey they : ham ne aur sarey mulk ne Allah ke) hukm aur farman ki pabandi ke) liye Sham ki. sab tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi, wo akelaa hai, uska koi Sharik nahi. aey Allah ! main tujh se is raat ki aur is mein maujood har bhalai ka sawal karta hun aur main tujh se is raat ke aur is mein maujood har shar se panah ka talabgaar hun. aey Allah ! main teri panah mangta hun, susti taari ho janey se aur umr (ke had se) badh janey se aur budhapey ki kharabi se aur duniya ke har fitney aur qabr ke azab se. Hasan-bin- Ubaidullah ne kaha : Zubeda ne mujhey Ibrahim-bin Suwaid ( Nakhai ( se, unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat kartey huey mazeed ye bataya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (jab Sham kartey to) ye farmatey : Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi, wo akelaa hai, uska koi Sharik nahi, saari badhshahat usi ki hai, sab tareef usi ke qaabil hai aur wahi har cheez par qaadir hai."
"6910","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (dua kartey huey ye) farmaya kartey they : akeley Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi, us ne apne lashkar ko izzat di, apne bandey ki nusrat ki, akelaa wo tamam jamaton par ghalib aaya,  (wahi aakhir hai) uske baad kuchh nahi."
"6911","abu-Kuraib Muhammad-bin-Alaa ne hamein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein ( Abdullah ( bin-Idrees ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Aasim-bin-kaleeb se suna, unhon-ne abu-Barda se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : (dua kartey huey ye) kaho : aey Allah ! mujhey hidayat de aur mujhey seedhey rastey par chala , aur (aey Ali !) hidayat (ka naam letey huey us) se sahi rastey par chalney ko zahan mein rakho aur seedha rehney se teer jaisi sadhaai murad lo (maangtey huey hidayat aur sawab ka kamaal talab karo.)"
"6912","ibne-Numair ne kaha : hamein Abdullah-bin-Idris ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Aasim-bin-kaleeb ne isi sanad ke sath khabar di (ke Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : (aey Ali ! ye ( kaho : aey Allah ! main tujh se hidayat aur raasti ka sawal karta hun. phir usi ki tarah bayan kiya."
"6913","Kureb ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Juweriya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah ki Namaz padhney ke baad subah sawerey unke yahaan se bahar tashrif le gaey, is waqt wo apni Namaz padhney wali jagah mein thin, phir din chadhney ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas wapas tashrif laey to wo (usi tarah) baithi hui thin. aap ne farmaya : tum ab tak usi haalat mein baithi hui ho jis par main tumhen chhod kar gaya tha? unhon-ne kaha : ji haan , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey (yahaan se janey ke) baad maine char kalimey teen baar kahey hain, agar unko inke sath tolaa jaey jo tum ne aaj ke din ab tak kaha hai to ye unse wazan mein badh jayen :                                                                        (سبحان الله وبحمده عدد خلقہ ورضا نفسہ وزنۃ عرشۃ ومداد كلماتہ)                                                                                                         ''pakeezgi hai Allah ki aur uski tareef ke sath , jitni uski makhlooq ki ginti hai aur jitni usko pasand hai aur jitna uske arsh ka wazan aur jitni uske kalimaat ki siyaahi hai.''"
"6914","abu-Rushdain ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Juweriya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : subah ki Namaz ke waqt ya subah ki Namaz ke baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guzartey huey unke yahaan tashrif laey. padhi. phir us (pichhli hadis) ke mutabiq bayan kiya. padhi. magar unhon-ne (apne kalimon ko is tarah) bayan kiya : main Allah ki tasbeeh bayan karta hun jitni uski makhlooqat ki gintii hai, main Allah ki tasbeeh bayan karta hun jitni uski raza hai, main Allah ki tasbeeh bayan karta hun jitna uske arsh ka wazan hai, main Allah ki tasbeeh karta hun jitni uske kalimaat ki siyaahi hai."
"6915","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Hakam se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine ibne-abi-Lela se suna, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko chakki peesney se jo zahmat bardasht karni padi uski wjah se unke hathon mein takleef hui. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh qaidi aaey. aap ki taraf gain, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) ghar mein) na paya. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se milin aur unhein (apni takleef ke barey mein) bataya. jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne aapko un (hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) (ke apne paas aaney ke barey mein bataya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahaan tashrif laey. padhi. us waqt ham apne apney bistaron mein ja chukey they. ham khadey honey lagey to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : donon apni apni jagah par raho. aap ham donon ke darmyan ( wali jagah par) baith gaey yahan tak ke maine aap ke qadam Mubarak ki thandak apne seeney par mehsus ki, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya tum donon ne jo mujh se maanga hai main tumhen us se behtar baat na sikhlaaoon? jab tum donon apne apney bistaron mein jao to chauntis (34) baar Allahu-akbar kaho, tentis (33) baar Subhan-Allah kaho aur tentis (33) baar Alhamdulilah kaho , ye (amal ( tum donon ke liye aik khaadim (mil janey) se behtar hai."
"6916","Wakee, Muaz aur ibne-abi-Adi sab ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur Muaz ki hadis mein hai : jab tum donon raat ke waqt apne bistar mein chaley jao."
"6917","Ubaidullah-bin-abi-Yazeed aur Ata-bin-abi-Ribah ne Mujahid se, unhon-ne ibne-abi-Lela se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah hadis bayan ki jis tarah Hakam ne ibne-abi-Lela se riwayat ki. unhon-ne hadis mein mazeed ye bayan kiya ke Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine jab se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye baat suni maine kabhi usey tark nahi kiya. unse puchha kya : jange-siffeen ki raat bhi nahi chhoda? unhon-ne jawab diya :  jange-siffeen ki raat bhi) usey nahi chhoda ). Ata ne jo hadis Mujahid se aur unhon-ne ibne-abi-Lela se riwayat ki, unhon ( ibne-abi-Lela ( ne kaha : maine un (Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) se kaha :  jange-siffeen ki raat bhi na chhoda?"
"6920","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum murgh ki aawaz suno to Allah Taala se uske Fazal ka sawal karo, kyonke (us waqt) us ne aik Farishtey ko dekha hai aur jab tum gadhey ki aawaz suno to shaitan se Allah ki panah maango kyonke us ne shaitan ko dekha hai."
"6921","Muaz-bin-Hisham ne kaha : mujhey mere walid ne Qatada se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Aaliya se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bechaini ke waqt ye dua kiya kartey they : Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi jo sabse azeem hai, sabse zyada hilm wala hai. Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi jo arshe-azeem ka Malik hai. Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi jo aasmanon ka Malik , zaminon ka Malik aur izzat waley arsh ka Malik hai."
"6922","Wakee ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, lekin Muaz-bin-Hisham ki hadis zyada mukammal hai."
"6923","hamein Saeed-bin-abi-Aruba ne Qatada se riwayat ki, abu-Aaliya riyaahi ne unhein Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bechaini ke waqt in alfaz se dua farmatey they, phir wahi kalimaat zikr kiye jo Muaz-bin-Hisham ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Qatada se riwayat kiye, magar unhon-ne   ((رب السماوات و رب الارض) ke bajaey) (رب السماوات والارض) kaha,"
"6924","Hammaad-bin-Salma ne kaha : mujhey Yousuf-bin-Abdullah-bin-Haaris ne abu-Aaliya se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab koi sakht mushkil aur takleef deh mamla darpesh hota to aap farmatey, phir isi tarah bayan kiya jis tarah Muaz ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki hai aur un kalimaat ke sath (لا الہ الا لله العظيم الحليم) ke baad (لا الہ الا لله رب العرش الكريم) mazeed bayan kiya."
"6925","Wuhaib ne kaha : hamein Saeed Jurairi ne abu Abdullah jasri se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne ibne-Samit se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kya gaya : (Allah ke zikr ke liye) kon sa kalima afzal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisey Allah ne apne farishton ke liye ya (un samet ( apne tamam bandon ke liye muntakhab farmaya hai : (سبحان الله وبحمده) main (har nemat ke liye) Allah ki hamd ke sath har na-shaayaan cheez se uski pakeezgi bayan karta hun."
"6926","Shoba ne Jarir se, unhon-ne abu-Adbullah jasri se jo anza qabeeley se they, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Samit se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya main tumhen wo kalima na bataaun jo Allah Taala ko sabse zyada mahboob hai? maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! mujhey wo kalima bataiye jo Allah Taala ko sabse zyada mahboob hai, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ko sabse zyada mahboob kalima (سبحان الله وبحمده) hai."
"6927","Fuzel ne Talha bin Ubaidullah bin kurez se, unhon-ne Umme- Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Hazrat abu Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi musalman banda nahi jo apne bhai ki peeth peechhey uske liye dua karey, magar aik farishta (hai jo ( kehta hai : tumhen bhi iske jaisi miley."
"6928","Musa bin Sarwaan Muallim ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Talha bin Ubaidullah bin kurez ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Hazrat Umme- Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mere aaqa ( khawind ( ne mujh se bayan kya ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jis shakhs ne apne bhai ke liye uski peeth peechhey dua ki to jo farishta uske sath muqarrar hai wo kehta hai : Aameen aur tumhen bhi usi ki tarah ata ho."
"6930","Safwan ne kaha : main bazar ki taraf nikla to Hazrat abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi meri mulaqat hui, unhon-ne bhi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kartey huey mujh se wahi kuchh kaha (jo unki biwi Hazrat umme-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tha.)"
"6931","Yazid-bin-Harun ne Abdul-Malik bin abi Sulaiman se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki, aur kaha : Safwan bin-Abdullah-bin Safwan se riwayat hai,"
"6932","abu-Usama aur Muhammad-bin-Bishr ne Zakariya-bin abi Zayda se, unhon-ne Saeed bin abi Burda se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala is baat par (apne ( bandey se razi hota hai ke wo aik khana khaaey aur is par Allah ki hamd karey ya peeney ki koi cheez (pani, doodh wghaira) piye aur is par Allah ki hamd kare."
"6933","Ishaq bin-Yoosuf azraq ne kaha : hamein Zakariya-bin abi Zayda ne Saeed bin abi Burda se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ( aagey ( usi ki tarah ( hai.)"
"6934","Imam Malik ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne ibne- azhar ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Ubaid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se kisi shakhs ki dua us waqt tak qabool hoti hai jab tak wo jald bazi kartey huey ye nahi kehta : maine dua ki, lekin mere haq mein qabool nahi hoti . padhi. ya nahi hui."
"6935","Aqeel-bin-Khalid ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Ubaid ne hadis bayan ki. padhi. aur wo Qurra (behtreen andaz mein Quran padhnewalon) aur ahale-fiqh (Islami Qanunon ke expert) mein se hain. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se kisi bhi shakhs ki dua qabool hoti hai jab tak wo jald bazi na karey aur ye ( na ( kahey : maine apne rab se dua ki to usne mujhey meri dua ka jawab nahi diya ( meri dua qabool nahi ki.)"
"6936","abu-Idrees Kholani ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jab tak koi banda gunah ya qata rehmi ki dua na karey aur qabooliyat ke mamley mein jald bazi na karey, uski dua qabool hoti rehti hai. kaha gaya : Allah ke rasool! jald bazi karna kya hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo kahey : maine dua ki aur maine dua ki aur mujhey nazar nahi aata ke wo mere haq mein qabool karega, phir us marhaley mein (maayus ho kar) thak jaey aur dua karna chhod de."